msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "1180408"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180440"
msgid "Praetor, don't you remember that the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF called us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180528"
msgid "Let's go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF first.\nIf we barge in without a plan,\nwe'll just get what's coming to us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180656"
msgid "Huh? Are you okay with not going to the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180736"
msgid "I follow, carefree, to wherever Darling\nunwittingly ends up.\nKya! What a good wife I am!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180828"
msgid "Oh? Have a bird brain, do we?\nIsn't there a place we should visit before\nentering the Labyrinth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180928"
msgid "We need to do something about that wall first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1180976"
msgid "Hm… Even if we go into the #C000246204Sakura Maze#CDEF now,\nour predicament won't change unless we\ndo something about that wall, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181116"
msgid "In a hurry to meet your demise, mongrel?\nSurely we must check where this\n#C000246204Sessyoin#CDEF person is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181228"
msgid "Are you sure we shouldn't be reporting\nwhat we heard to that lot in the Student\nCouncil Room?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181324"
msgid "We should go report what we heard just.\nMaster, let's head to the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181412"
msgid "Huh? Is it okay not to report what we\njust heard to everyone?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181476"
msgid "I like waste when it has a benefit to it,\nbut I don't like fruitless efforts that bring\nno benefit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181576"
msgid "Tell the Student Council of #C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF's remarks.\nWe'll come back after."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181664"
msgid "That's right. Let's first head to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF and\nreport to #C236196003Leo#CDEF about that strategy we can use against the wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181824"
msgid "Before going in, I'll head to the #C000246204Student\nCouncil Room#CDEF. Things will go smoother if we\nfirst decide on a plan of action for today's search."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1181980"
msgid "This isn't #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's room.\nIf I recall correctly, I think her room\nwas at the #C000246204right, far end of the first floor#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182124"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182264"
msgid "First I want to head to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF\nto talk about what happened and what we're going to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182388"
msgid "A Shield is raised beyond the Labyrinth.\nWe need to save #C236196003Gatou#CDEF, so let's return the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF for a bit and report on\nwhat just happened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182572"
msgid "Greetings are an important part of\ncommunication. All the more towards comrades\nyou fight alongside with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182680"
msgid "So, Praetor. It's not bad to go Labyrinth\nexploring right after waking up, but why not\nstop by the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182820"
msgid "Hm?\nYou're not going to visit the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1182892"
msgid "Well, it's not essential to do, but I think\na good order of things would be to go\ngreet them before heading out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183008"
msgid "It makes #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF's heart pound to see\nDarling beeline for#ROFS-004#RUBSthe dungeon#RUBE work#REND right after\nwaking up鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183148"
msgid "But we should have a brief get-together.\nShall we visit the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF and\nhave a teeeensy bit of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's tea?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183304"
msgid "Straight to exploring the Labyrinth, huh?\nI suppose this is how a mongrel shows\ntheir sincerity, but relax a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183424"
msgid "Who ever heard of a slave in a hurry?\nFirst visit the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF\nand discuss today's theme."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183544"
msgid "More importantly, the outfit!\nLet's hurry over to #C000246204where Rin is#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183624"
msgid "Phew. I can finally say bye to this outfit.\nLet's head to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183732"
msgid "Woohoo☆ A new outfit, a new outfit!\nLet's hurry and #C000246204go pick it up#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183816"
msgid "Did you not hear the transmission just now?\nYou should go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1183920"
msgid "Have you found a way to break through\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's Relief, Praetor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184000"
msgid "It's fine if you have, otherwise you could\nstart by asking your #C000246204friends for advice#CDEF, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184104"
msgid "Going to the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, Master? Moving\naround can get the ideas flowing, but shouldn't\nyou #C000246204rely on your friends#CDEF for this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184268"
msgid "What will we do about #C236196003Rani#CDEF's Relief? It would\nbe nice if we found a clue while walking\naround the Labyrinth, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184400"
msgid "Have you thought of a way to break through\nthe Relief? If not, then don't go bumbling\ninto the Labyrinth, buffoon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184516"
msgid "If you want the #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF to go along\nwith you, then come up with a suitable\nplan first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184628"
msgid "We'll need #C000246204Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's help at this point.\nBefore we enter the labyrinth, let's talk to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184744"
msgid "…let's head back to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF. We need to\ndiscuss what's happened."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184844"
msgid "I'm also curious about what happened to the\nLabyrinth, but first let's go to the #C000246204Student\nCouncil Room#CDEF and work out a plan of action."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1184996"
msgid "What's wrong, Master? Still asleep?\nDidn't they tell you to head to the #C000246204Student\nCouncil Room#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185108"
msgid "Huh? Are you alright with not going to the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF? Well, it's just that we\nalways go there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185232"
msgid "You look like you want to say something.\nThen let me have a guess at it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185308"
msgid "\"Won't you ask if we're not going to the\nStudent Council Room?\"\nRight?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185380"
msgid "Buffoon! If you already know then don't waste\nmy time! Hurry to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185488"
msgid "Praetor, weren't we going to return to the\nStudent Council Room?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185556"
msgid "Wait, Master. Let's head back to the Student\nCouncil Room first. I'm curious about that\ncompressed data we found."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185672"
msgid "Huh? I thought we were going back to the\nStudent Council Room, no?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185740"
msgid "Mongrel. They just said to return to the\nStudent Council Room, no? You already forgot?\nAre you actually a birdbrain?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185860"
msgid "Oh, yeah. Let's head back to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF\nfor now and ask about the data we just obtained."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1185980"
msgid "Oops, can't be going in here.\nI think #C236196003Leo#CDEF wanted me to ask #C236196003Kiara#CDEF\nabout her #RUBS     advice on #RUBEimpression of#REND #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186160"
msgid "I need to head to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF to get briefed first.\nIt's best to have plenty of clear communication\nwith #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the others, who are backing me up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186356"
msgid "Let's entrust the Student Council with the\nreconstruction of the data we obtained.\nThis might be the data we're hoping for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186480"
msgid "I haven't reported on what happened yesterday yet.\nLet's head to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF and exchange\ninformation with #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186652"
msgid "Let's head to the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF\nafter gathering some more information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186744"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1186872"
msgid "I'm not very eager about it, but the truth is\nthat without #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, we're at a stalemate.\nWe have to do this. #C000246204Let's go persuade her#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187036"
msgid "What's wrong? Were we not going to devise a\nplan with the woman in the custodial room?\nGo to the #C000246204Janitor's Closet#CDEF, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187192"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF questions if I \"forgot about\nthe call from the Student Council Room.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187284"
msgid "Of course, I wouldn't forget.\nLet's be good and get ourselves up to the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187396"
msgid "I deviated from my usual routine of\nwaking up then going to the Student Council Room,\nand now I'm here in front of the cherry blossom tree…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187540"
msgid "But there's nothing special going on here.\nI'll just quietly make my way to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187660"
msgid "The moment I reached for the cherry blossom tree\nto enter the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF,\nI recalled what #C236196003Gawain#CDEF said just now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187812"
msgid "#C236196003Gawain#CDEF went of his way to come call us.\nI can't bring myself to waste his effort.\nLet's go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1187964"
msgid "You want to save #C236196003Jinako#CDEF as soon as possible.\nI know how you feel, but we're stopping by the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188116"
msgid "#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF's true intention wasn't for us to\npointlessly storm in and exhaust ourselves,\nwas it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188232"
msgid "Wait. Let's go to the #C000246204Student Council#CDEF first.\nI understand why you want to hurry, but this\nis precisely when we need to be cautious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188380"
msgid "Darling, Darling.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF said he had something to discuss with us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188460"
msgid "The mongrels in the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF\nare quite useful, for what they're worth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188560"
msgid "Going into the Labyrinth simply to go will be\na great expense of labor, will it not?\nFirst head for the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188704"
msgid "I got plenty of rest.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188764"
msgid "I really want to get into the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF\nas soon as possible, but first let's\ngo to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF.\nThere's a ton of things to discuss."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1188948"
msgid "Before we head to the Labyrinth, let's stop\nby the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need some advice regarding the invitation #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF sent…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189116"
msgid "We can go back into the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF,\nbut we're at a dead-end…\nDo you still wish to enter?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189228"
msgid "Didn't #C236196003Rani#CDEF mention something about\nhaving something to report?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189308"
msgid "We've already gone all the way to the\nend of the fifteenth floor.\nWhat shall we do?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189392"
msgid "Did you forget that we JUST left the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you really\nare a birdbrain…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189520"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189612"
msgid "We need #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's help if we want to get any further.\nLet's go meet with #C000246204Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189724"
msgid "It's too soon.\nFirst, we need to deliver #RUBSthe Code Cast#RUBEit#REND to the\nStudent Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189828"
msgid "Master, we're strapped for time, here.\nLet's deliver the Code Cast we obtained to\nthe Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1189936"
msgid "I understand how you feel. However, but out of\nrespect for that brat's wishes, we need to take\nthat to the Student Council Room, quickly!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190076"
msgid "You intend to take his pride in vain?\nWhat you need to do is go to the Student Council\nRoom and deliver the Code Cast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190196"
msgid "Hearing #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's words, I resist the urge to run\nback into the Labyrinth. Let's go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF\nand deliver the #C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190396"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF will be in trouble if I don't hurry.\nHelping her deserves my full attention\nright now more than exploring the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190540"
msgid "Praetor, let's go rest already.\nYou saved #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nBe proud and make your triumphant return."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190648"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF probably hasn't fully recovered.\nShe can't offer us any backup.\nLet's leave the exploring for tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190776"
msgid "Darling, you seem very tired.\nLet's go back to My Room and get lovey-dovey―\nScratch that, get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1190884"
msgid "Wait. One person can only work so hard. You\ndefeated a dragon of mixed race―even if she was\na degenerate. Go to your room and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191020"
msgid "We can't beat #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF without\nhaving a plan. Let's first go to the Student\nCouncil and come up with one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191168"
msgid "Please, wait. I know I always say this, but our\nenemy this time is strong. Let's first go to\nthe Student Council Room and discuss this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191304"
msgid "Our enemies will be even stronger. I think it's\nbest to come up with a plan before we fight\nand increase our chances even if only some."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191440"
msgid "Wait. You won't be able to play\naround in the areas ahead.\nCome up with a plan, first. THEN fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191540"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nFirst, let's go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF\nand come up with a strategy along with #C236196003Rin#CDEF and the others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191708"
msgid "We need to deliver the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF to #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nI can't let his effort go to waste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191840"
msgid "Don't rush, Praetor.\nDidn't I remind you to not forget about\nvisiting the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1191952"
msgid "I thought I had suggested that we go to the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF… That must mean you\nweren't listening, right, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192088"
msgid "Darling! Before that, let's have some tea\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF.\n…I just told you this, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192204"
msgid "Birdbrain.\nForget the Labyrinth.\nFirst we go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192296"
msgid "Something is off.\nI would liken this small discomfort I feel\nto wearing one's socks on the wrong foot."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192400"
msgid "Aren't we going to go to the Student Council\nRoom today, Praetor?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192468"
msgid "Seems like that's because you're not heading\ntowards the Student Council Room this morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192560"
msgid "Are you fine with not going to\nthe Student Council Room?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192620"
msgid "That's because you're not heading towards\nthe Student Council Room, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192700"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF points it out as if reading my mind.\nThat is indeed correct.\nTo the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF we go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192836"
msgid "…let's go back to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF and\nhammer out the guidelines for what's to come."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1192948"
msgid "…I place my hand on the cherry blossom tree.\nBut my mind feels sluggish, and I just can't bring myself\nto enter the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193100"
msgid "…oh, yeah. I wonder how #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are faring?\nLet's go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF and check…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193248"
msgid "Before we go to the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, isn't\nthere something on your mind? No need to say,\nit's written all over your face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193388"
msgid "Feels like in one and ear and out the other.\nBefore exploring the Labyrinth, isn't there\nsomething we need to take care of?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193512"
msgid "Hee hee hee…\nLook at me, worrying about my rivals.\nThe first wife has such a safe spot, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193608"
msgid "There's something we need to do before heading\nto battle. Kings strive to fortify their\nfoundation. Lend your subjects your ear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193740"
msgid "Oh, yeah.\nThere's something we need to do before going\nto the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF.\n#C000246204How are Rin and Rani doing#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193880"
msgid "…oh, yeah.\nI haven't seen #C236196003Sakura#CDEF around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1193940"
msgid "Alright, first we need to do something about #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF.\nLet's go consult #C000246204Rani#CDEF about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194064"
msgid "I don't mind going into the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, but…\nWhat about our matter with #C236196003Karna#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194184"
msgid "Wait, aren't we supposed to be somewhere\nother than the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194276"
msgid "Kya! Oh, Darling!\nYou're simply loathe to part with me,\naren't you? #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF. Is. In. Heaven.鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194388"
msgid "Were you not listening when they said that\nno matter how much we strengthen ourselves,\nwe have no chance of success?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194508"
msgid "I'm making an exception to allow another\nServant to accompany you. Now be off,\nspeak with him!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194604"
msgid "Oh, right. I need to go to the #C000246204Janitor's Closet#CDEF\nto convince #C236196003Jinako#CDEF to let me borrow #C236196003Karna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194744"
msgid "I need to #C000246204go tell Rani#CDEF about what happened with #C236196003Karna#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194832"
msgid "Wait, this isn't where I'm supposed to go.\nI can always come back here with #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nAnd to do so, we need to draw out #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's power…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1194996"
msgid "Praetor. This will likely be our last excursion.\nHow about stopping by the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195112"
msgid "Did you remember to go say bye\nto the girls, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195168"
msgid "Darling, we'll soon be parting ways with\nthe girls. Please give them a farewell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195252"
msgid "This will be our last excursion.\nMongrel, go give some words of\nappreciation to your vassals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195348"
msgid "I figured she would ask me this at some point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195396"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF say nothing about my judgement to me.\nBut #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is a different story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195528"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks away, slightly embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195588"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said that she likes me.\nShe did all of those things because she likes me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195692"
msgid "Maybe this #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here understands where she's coming from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195768"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF looks away, slightly embarrassed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195828"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF said that she likes #C236196003Archer#CDEF.\nShe did all of those things because she likes him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1195952"
msgid "Maybe this #C236196003Sakura#CDEF here understands where she's coming from."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1196028"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196048"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's eyes widen, and she's at a loss for words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196116"
msgid "The short, actually, very long silence eventually breaks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196176"
msgid "Erm, this is odd.\nI thought I wouldn't like the idea\nof being lumped together with them, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196272"
msgid "I feel relieved.\nIn any case, I'm happy to hear that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196328"
msgid "She is who she is, I am who I am.\nI'll support you until the very end.\nI'll do my best!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196416"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF, I wish to speak with you in private."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196480"
msgid "Praetor. Please wait in the\ncorner of the room for us to finish.\nDon't move a muscle until I tell you to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196588"
msgid "…ahem.\nThere's only one thing to ask about:\nThe Psycho Dive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196652"
msgid "I'm not particularly afraid or anything,\njust a little uneasy.\nI'll be consulting you on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196748"
msgid "I could tell where the Presi…\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF was inside of me,\nbut it was mysterious, a new feeling…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196860"
msgid "It felt like heat from a different source\nthan myself was racing through my nerves.\nIt was warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1196960"
msgid "But, um… It felt like\nevery inch of my body was being looked at…\nEmbarrassment is one thing I felt plenty of…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197076"
msgid "T-that certainly is embarrassing!\nI learned much from this!\nYou have my thanks, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197180"
msgid "…ahem. Now then, my Praetor,\nlooking so glum up against that wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197248"
msgid "For no particular reason,\nI'm going to go take a little bath.\nWait for me here until I finish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197344"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF? Do you have a moment to spare?\nI have a brief thing I would like to speak\nto you about in private."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197468"
msgid "Ah, please go sit in that chair there, Darling.\nCount cherry petals in the schoolyard. Be like,\n\"aren't cherry trees in bloom so romantic?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197608"
msgid "…okay. There's only one topic to discuss:\nThe experience of your mental dive, please."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197696"
msgid "As you can imagine, I kind of don't have \nexperience with having my mind… or rather,\nmy body adventured in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197808"
msgid "What does it feel like? Does it actually hurt?\nIf it does, in what way? Like a cavity\nor a headache, something of that nature?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1197936"
msgid "This level of exposure\nis right up #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF's alley."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198004"
msgid "Now then, that's enough of our secret talk.\nDid I keep you waiting, Darling?\nOkay, let's go full speed ahead!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198116"
msgid "Yeah. Although I'll be dormant during the dive,\nmy immune functions will still be working.\nDon't take detours, go straight for the goal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198256"
msgid "Fool. Don't speak as if your Spiritron makeup\nis anything equivalent to mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198336"
msgid "My flesh possesses the supreme Golden Rule.\nIt's the finest work of art on this entire\ncelestial body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198440"
msgid "To one who is ordinary, every part of me\nis a perilous poison. Go forth steeled,\nand try not to become charmed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198552"
msgid "I called out to #C236196003Sakura#CDEF as I went to hand over\nthe Classic Sailor Uniform I got a hold of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198660"
msgid "……but just as she turned around,\nI got a little nervous,\nwondering if I was just being presumptuous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198764"
msgid "No, no, no, it would be a complete waste to stop now.\n#[It's not like I'm going to wear a girl's uniform, anyways.][I don't need a second set of the same uniform anyway.]#"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1198936"
msgid "I grasped the folded uniform tightly,\nresolved myself,\nand thrust the uniform in front of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199052"
msgid "\"I know this is sudden,\n but #[please take this][take this]#, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!\""
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "1199140"
msgid "　Handed over the\n#C245150095#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199188"
msgid "Since #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's an ally helping us escape from\nthe Far Side of the Moon,\nI absolutely want her to wear this uniform too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199324"
msgid "Please return it to #C236196003Father Kotomine#CDEF at once,\nand buy something else with it.\nLike a recovery item, or a Mystic Code!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199460"
msgid "It hurts to have #C236196003Sakura#CDEF reject it so profusely.\nI did expect her to be confused by it,\nbut I didn't expect her to say \"No.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199600"
msgid "Ah… T-that's not it…… I just meant\nthat we should keep an order of priorities\nbased on the situation…… so……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199716"
msgid "I don't want to inconvenience you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nSo it's not as if I don't like it,\nor anything like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199836"
msgid "I look up and say \"In that case……\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1199876"
msgid "\"If you're really not opposed to the uniform, then――\n as an ally of the Student Council,\n and an ally who supports #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF,\n I definitely want you to wear it.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200064"
msgid "\"It'll definitely look good on you, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200128"
msgid "………you're a curious person, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nNo one else seems to mind things like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200228"
msgid "……I understand. Since I need to change,\nwill you accompany me to the Infirmary?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200312"
msgid "I left the Student Council Room along with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200380"
msgid "What is it that you need?\n………wha――? You're giving me a uniform?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200452"
msgid "I am very grateful for your consideration,\nbut I cannot accept this\nunder the current circumstances."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200556"
msgid "This Sm belongs to #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF……\nSo please put it towards\nexploring the Labyrinth instead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200660"
msgid "……I know what #C236196003Sakura#CDEF just said isn't wrong.\nIf I didn't go out of my way to prepare this uniform,\nI wouldn't have run into as many issues as I have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200828"
msgid "I did want to see #C236196003Sakura#CDEF in the classic school uniform,\nbut I should give up on this for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1200940"
msgid "She usually turns her head and gives me a smile,\nbut she was gazing somewhere far off, looking depressed.\nIt seems as if she hasn't noticed me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201084"
msgid "Growing concerned, I try calling out to her again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201136"
msgid "It's rare for the hard working #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to be so sluggish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201212"
msgid "Which reminds me, when I was diving into #C236196003Rin#CDEF's\nLabyrinth Core, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF helped me out as well.\nCould that have been really taxing on her…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201384"
msgid "No structural defects exist\nin AI who are products of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nHowever, #C236196003BB#CDEF appeared――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201512"
msgid "…I see. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF are identical models.\nIf #C236196003BB#CDEF did go rogue, that means it could happen with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201684"
msgid "For humans, no one could use \"because they're human\" as\na reason to say that another person and I are the exact same.\nFor those two AI, it's different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1201836"
msgid "No matter how different they are on the inside,\nas long as they were made from the same design,\nthe same outcome would be possible for both…\nShe must've realized that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202008"
msgid "But this really isn't something she needs to worry about.\nThe cause for her going rogue is most likely a bug, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202128"
msgid "As a comrade in the Student Council, as our ally,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is protecting the health of everyone in this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202256"
msgid "In our last meeting,\neveryone must have confirmed as much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202316"
msgid "Yes. I was truly happy\nafter hearing everyone's words back then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202384"
msgid "…but I can't ignore the chance of a defect\nlying within me as much as you all trust me.\nI can't say for sure that a bug won't appear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202520"
msgid "When I think about how, by some catalyst,\nI may end up like #C236196003BB#CDEF, I wonder if staying here\nis the right choice or―aahh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202656"
msgid "I aim for the defenseless #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's forehead,\nand let loose a light karate chop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202752"
msgid "A critical hit! Sakura has been stunned!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202796"
msgid "Supposing that #C236196003Sakura#CDEF doesn't trust herself, everyone else DOES.\nBefore thinking about the \"worst case scenario,\"\nI want her to turn to the words of her comrades."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1202976"
msgid "Plus, if #C236196003Sakura#CDEF were to ever go rogue like #C236196003BB#CDEF,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF would do\neverything in #[his][her]# power to stop #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203160"
msgid "I spoke pridefully to my kouhai,\n\"I'll karate chop you over the brow until you cry,\n so don't worry so much.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203272"
msgid "…yes, you're right. I have everyone by\nmy side, and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF even comes to visit me\nto see how I'm doing, like now――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203408"
msgid "I won't make mistakes.\nI don't expect them to happen.\nI won't become #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203500"
msgid "I put my strength into a solid nod at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203576"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, and I won't let that happen.\nSo… someway, somehow, I want her to feel at ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203700"
msgid "…yes! To make sure the trust\neveryone's put in me won't be in vain,\nI'll keep trying my very, very best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203808"
msgid "Yeah. Now that that's settled, I can't be\nstanding here daydreaming. I have to return to\nthe Student Council Room now. Yes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1203932"
msgid "I had #C236196003#SVT[Saber][Archer][Caster][Gilgamesh]##CDEF wait in the classroom because\n#SVT[she][he][she][he]# was a little hard on the eyes… erm,\n#SVT[she][he][she][he]# looks different from what you're used to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204152"
msgid "Waking up from a long sleep is mentally\ndraining enough for you, so I had them wait\nsomewhere else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204252"
msgid "…um.\nAnyway, please don't be surprised, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204300"
msgid "About #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF―― He was looking all around\nthe old school building and\nwouldn't listen to me at all――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204424"
msgid "Y-you're asking about money?\nI'm sorry. I wish to help you in\nas many ways as I can, but……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204520"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF does not pay any wages.\nThus I am, one could say, penniless…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204612"
msgid "And the Labyrinth's value of currency……\nits excess memory is different than what's\non the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204728"
msgid "I wonder what it is about the name \"Sakurament.\"\nFor some reason, it feels incredibly malicious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204828"
msgid "Um, how about collecting some locally?\nM-manual labor is a wonderful thing, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1204916"
msgid "You want to know where #C236196003Shinji#CDEF is?\nUmm, please give me a second to look him up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205012"
msgid "…huh? He's not in the hallways.\nThere's two signals in the Janitor's Closet…\nBut isn't that where #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205140"
msgid "I'll be assisting everyone from here on out.\nSpecifically, as an OS that executes and\nsupports #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's operations."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205280"
msgid "Currently, I'm using root to also serve as\nthe main CPU that makes up the old\nschool building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205376"
msgid "In case of an emergency, I'll open the\nInfirmary right back up if anyone needs it.\nSo please don't worry."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205484"
msgid "As a health management AI, I'm against\nyou entering the cherry blossom tree, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205568"
msgid "Hee hee, I'm a pretty lousy nurse.\nI ended up concluding that you're all making\nthe right decision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205668"
msgid "I won't cut any corners while supporting you.\nI'll do my best to try and be as\nhelpful to everyone as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205780"
msgid "How did you like My Room?\nIf anything inconveniences you,\nplease tell me, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205860"
msgid "Me? No issues in the slightest.\nThis boost to my analytic functions actually\nhas me feeling in tip-top shape!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1205972"
msgid "Asking about my destabilized emotional values?\nThank you for your concern."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206048"
msgid "But there's no need to worry.\nSince my optimization program is running,\nI'll adapt to the changes soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206160"
msgid "When we're installing new software,\nthis sort of thing happens more often\nthan you'd think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206252"
msgid "You want to know about #C236196003Jinako#CDEF? As far\nas I know, she hasn't taken a single step\noutside of the Janitor's Closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206384"
msgid "So I don't have any new information on her.\nMy apologies……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206448"
msgid "How did it go with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?\n*sigh*… She really won't leave the\nJanitor's Closet, will she…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206556"
msgid "The custodial room is similar to My Room for\nyou, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. But since it's in an\nalmost offline state, I worry a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206692"
msgid "To think such a large wall could exist…\nthis would never happen on the Near Side…\nso what's going on with this Labyrinth…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206820"
msgid "And, umm……\nIt's a lot more, organic and――\nbizarre, than it needs to be……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1206900"
msgid "Wha―― You're going inside the Relief?\nThat's unknown territory.\nIs this really going to be okay…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207004"
msgid "……no. Even if safety isn't guaranteed,\nthis is not a situation where we can afford\nto let that stop us. Isn't that right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207128"
msgid "…you need to quickly ask about #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's plan…\nThis is an important task, so I will not\nallow you to fail!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207252"
msgid "However, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF has nothing with him. I can't\nscan the entirety of the Labyrinth, so I'm\nworried…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207368"
msgid "Anyway, rescuing #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is our highest priority\nright now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207444"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's previous outfit… There should be\nsome material on it around here… Hehe.\nI'm starting to feel a little excited."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207580"
msgid "Good morning.\nIt looks like there's no meeting this morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207644"
msgid "Sorry, I wasn't able to prepare anything else.\nPlease be careful during your search."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207732"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, if you ever feel tired,\nthen please take a break.\nHow about having some tea?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207836"
msgid "It would be nice to know what #C236196003Rani#CDEF likes…\nBut I don't currently have any data\non her to infer from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1207956"
msgid "Regardless, I can't believe I was the fastest\nto lose among us… I'm a disgrace as an AI…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208048"
msgid "Ahahaha. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is a little cruel, huh?\nEven though she's our enemy this time around,\nI sympathize with #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208192"
msgid "If I were #C236196003Rani#CDEF, I'd direct the school's\ntrash disposal towards the Janitor's Closet\nand do everything I could to open it up鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208336"
msgid "I can still confirm signs of Masters and\nNPCs within the Relief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208404"
msgid "I'm unable to measure the Relief's interior, but\nthere's no mistake that we must win against #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nin battle to free them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208544"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, we're counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208592"
msgid "Hurry, #C000246204go before the Relief#CDEF. We'll also be\nadvancing our setup for the #RUBS     spiral #RUBEdepth descent#REND…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208724"
msgid "I was a bit overloaded\nand my processing speed fell,\nso I had taken a break in the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208820"
msgid "Ah, I'm fine now. I'm able to exhibit\n100% performance, so please don't worry\nabout a thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208916"
msgid "I'm fine now. I'm operating completely normally.\nPlease leave the backup to me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1208996"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF are beings born from rogue AI.\nThe likelihood of their basic structures\nbeing malfunctioned are high."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209128"
msgid "Thus, even if they appear normal at a glance,\nplease don't ever let your guard down.\n…these girls are obstacles we must defeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209260"
msgid "There are others with the same model as me,\nbut I have no \"sister\" machines."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209340"
msgid "But when I'm looking at #C236196003Rin#CDEF, I sometimes\nimagine… if this is what having\nan older sister is like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209456"
msgid "Although it's unclear as to why I feel that way.\nMaybe the cause is because #C236196003Rin#CDEF is so caring\nthat I started to depend on her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209600"
msgid "I can tell by looking at your face, I don't\neven need to scan it. I AM an apprentice\nin health management AI, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209724"
msgid "Of course, I didn't forget about\nbringing supplies! Okay, please take this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209800"
msgid "The Student Council can back you up physically,\nbut we can't give care for mental fatigue.\nPlease take care of your body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1209924"
msgid "#C000246204Masochistic Constitution#CDEF…\nA constitution that inclines one towards\nacts of torment after seeing her, huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210048"
msgid "…it doesn't make much sense to me.\nI wonder why #C236196003BB#CDEF would add that sort of\ndefect to her own offshoot…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210168"
msgid "…my assumptions were too optimistic.\nNow I'm going to tighten the entrance's\nsecurity up more than ever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210276"
msgid "Even if #C236196003BB#CDEF herself tried, I won't let\nanyone invade this old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210364"
msgid "But I raised the density due to this incident.\nEven if an enemy were kitten-sized, anything,\nincluding their body, would be repelled back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210504"
msgid "It involves signals rather than a body, and\nwhile we're within the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, the Spiritron\nNetwork can't be cut even if we wanted to…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210656"
msgid "………ah… I-I'm sorry.\nI was a little out of it.\nIs there something I can do for you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210744"
msgid "…sorry, I lost myself for a second there.\nWell, two people is safer than one… I wasn't\nsurprised or anything, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210864"
msgid "Sorry for making you worry yesterday.\nI took my time debugging overnight,\nnow I'm up and ready to go!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1210968"
msgid "About your memories…\nUm, I know everyone is having a hard time\nright now, but keep being careful…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211068"
msgid "It's going to be okay, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWe'll definitely get back the memories\nyou still don't have yet, soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211188"
msgid "Black tea, black tea…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211212"
msgid "With or without your memories,\nI think that it doesn't change\nwho you are, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211296"
msgid "I spoke to just about every Master during\nthe 1st Round of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nbut I never got to speak with #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211448"
msgid "She was confined in the Janitor's Closet the\nentire time. That door transforms into the\nArena's entrance after the preliminaries end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211584"
msgid "…we're almost there, aren't we?\nThis will all be over soon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211648"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, we're counting on you.\nLet's escape from the Labyrinth this time,\nfor sure. That will lead to #C236196003BB#CDEF's deletion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211800"
msgid "Black tea mixed with coffee, plus sugar and\nmilk. That's an extra order I got from #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF.\nOh! And the lemon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211928"
msgid "He'll be in tip-top shape to provide\nbackup on his side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1211988"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, you seem tired.\nPlease go back to your My Room\nand have yourself a long rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212092"
msgid "I still have plenty of medicine, so please\nlet me know if you run out. It may only serve\nas a small solace, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212208"
msgid "You're always acting reckless, after all,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Please be sure to rest\nwhen it's time for a break."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212328"
msgid "Um, this might… not help wash away the taste,\nbut I tried making a bento for you.\nPlease eat it if you'd like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212440"
msgid "I hope it's to your liking…\nI'll be making lots more so I can hand out\nsome to #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF next."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212572"
msgid "Doing things like exchanging bentos will\ndefinitely liven up the place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212644"
msgid "I thought all it would do is put your mind at\nease, but it worked better than I\nthought it would. I'm glad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212752"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1212932"
msgid "I have to go see #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and figure out a way to solve this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213008"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213188"
msgid "Let's go after #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nIf she's going to be anywhere,\nmaybe she'll be around the deepest part of the\nSakura Labyrinth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213324"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF temporarily froze #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's body.\nThe encroachment is being suppressed for now,\nbut we don't know how long it'll hold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213504"
msgid "Let's enter #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's subconscious and\ncut out the bits eating away at her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213596"
msgid "Well of course. She's an AI gone rogue.\nShe seems logical, but she's holding on to\nchronic #RUBS    lag #RUBEemotions#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213720"
msgid "Things normal AIs would consider as fluctuating\nand cut out, she holds on to forever…. \nFrom the start, something was wrong with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213856"
msgid "…s-sorry…\nI find it difficult to speak when I look\nyou in the eyes now, Senpai…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1213940"
msgid "I'm not sure how to put this… I don't know\nthe reason why, but my chest feels warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214028"
msgid "Leave the rest to us.\nPlease go get some rest in My Room, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214096"
msgid "I'll take charge of getting #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nto rest before they grow exhausted.\nPlease let me take care of things!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214240"
msgid "Huh? Why are you laughing?\n\"I'm pretty dependable, oddly enough\"?\nY-you think so?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214324"
msgid "Welcome back. Did you forget something?\nWe have our system to back you up all set to go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214416"
msgid "To also double as thanks for saving me from the\nMelt Virus earlier, I put in a little extra\neffort! Please use it on your companion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214552"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are trying their hardest,\nbut please be very careful in the Labyrinth,\nokay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214676"
msgid "…there's less than a 10% chance of success,\nbut we have to do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214744"
msgid "Even after the building's power shuts off,\nI'll be able to handle your Navi on my own,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214856"
msgid "I can only do so much, but please let me\nhelp you until the end.\nIt's also my duty to do so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1214952"
msgid "Exploring the eighteenth floor comes first, yes?\nLet's not get distracted by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's\nCore, lest we ignore what's before us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215100"
msgid "…I want to step up in turn.\nNo matter what happens on the final floor,\nI'll definitely protect you, Senpai…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215212"
msgid "I know I did something unforgivable, but…\nI want to do my best for you,\nof my own volition――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215308"
msgid "I have no more hesitation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215336"
msgid "If you choose the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, where you\nmight perish, over this tranquil yet\nempty old school building, then――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215472"
msgid "A way to disable the #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215524"
msgid "Until we find a way, I won't open my Relief\nfor you. Please think of it as the bare\nminimum before facing #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215652"
msgid "If we can do it, then I also want\neveryone to return to the normal world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215728"
msgid "…huh?\nYou'd like some supplies for tomorrow, you say?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215784"
msgid "…huh?\nYou say the last thing you want is to have some\nof my bento? And you'll pay handsomely?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215880"
msgid "…oh, you. In terms of healing,\nelixirs are more effective and\nefficient, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1215964"
msgid "Hee hee… I was planning on giving you some\nregardless if you pleaded me or not. I've been\ngiving out supplies for a long time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216092"
msgid "Senpai, please stay safe tomorrow.\nGet plenty of rest tonight and clear your mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216176"
msgid "Tomorrow is when we finally reach the\n#C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF. Please get plenty\nof rest tonight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216284"
msgid "Those clothes… That's the uniform from\nback in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216380"
msgid "It couldn't have been that long ago,\nbut I feel very nostalgic looking at those."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216464"
msgid "Changing clothes every now and then makes\nfor a nice change of pace, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216548"
msgid "…hey.\nThere's something that's been bothering me.\nYou have a second?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216620"
msgid "It's about #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF.\nOut of curiosity, I had #C236196003Rani#CDEF look into her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216724"
msgid "We have nothing to be concerned about.\nIt's true that the western financial\nconglomerates went after her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216832"
msgid "The conglomerates went after her…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216868"
msgid "So #C236196003Kiara#CDEF is an enemy of those conglomerates――\nIs she a freelance hacker like #C236196003Rin#CDEF is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1216988"
msgid "No, she doesn't oppose anyone. Though the only\ndata we have comes from what we dug up here…\nCould you please, #C236196003Rani#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217124"
msgid "Yes. Starting from the conclusion,\nshe's a cybercriminal wanted by INTERPOL."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217204"
msgid "At one point,\nshe was the leader of a religious cyber cult.\nIt no longer exists, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217296"
msgid "And, well…\nAll the men and women in it idolized her\nso much that they all committed suicide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217392"
msgid "People who were smitten with her,\npeople with a thing for being abused by her,\npeople hooked on conversing with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217512"
msgid "People who detested her to death,\npeople who were crazy over her body…\nA lot of different folks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217612"
msgid "The end results were all the same: suicide.\nEven outside the internet, most of the people\nwho associated with her committed suicide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217748"
msgid "Included among them were even\ncyber investigators and spies from the\nconglomerates that had chased her around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217860"
msgid "What's astonishing is that apparently,\none spy died in order to save her\nfrom adherents who were out to kill her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1217976"
msgid "…according to these documents,\nthat person was apparently her lover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218048"
msgid "According to #C236196003Julius#CDEF, that person was\na misanthrope and didn't seem particularly\ninterested in women."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218168"
msgid "…personally, I can't comprehend\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's cognitive structure.\nShe's too much of an enigma."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218284"
msgid "She was betrayed by others over and over again.\nAnd yet, she didn't abandon her goal\nof bringing salvation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218392"
msgid "Or rather… It makes me think that\nshe's fine with being betrayed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218460"
msgid "You could say she has an indomitable spirit,\nbut in her case, it goes much too far."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218544"
msgid "I may not be one to say this, but…\nIt's as if she's a machine devoid of emotions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218628"
msgid "I think so, too. It's like she's obsessed\nwith being a hero of justice? Or something.\nShe's even being called \"the last saint.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218756"
msgid "One thing's for sure: she's the biggest victim.\nBut it's also true that she's the cause\nof mass suicide and conflict."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1218876"
msgid "Thus, with backing from the conglomerates,\nshe was added to the world's most wanted list.\nThough some came to her legal defense…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219008"
msgid "A woman emerges, is treated as a saint\nin the East, and disregards their group――\nGuess they couldn't let that one slip by."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219136"
msgid "You're being biased, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF.\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF was considered \"clearly a\nmodern-day saint,\" even by the Church."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219284"
msgid "The problem is that the person who started\ninsisting on that was a Church cardinal…\nAnd a candidate for the next papacy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219408"
msgid "The Holy Church didn't try to apprehend #C236196003Kiara#CDEF\nbecause she was some thorn in their side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219512"
msgid "They recognized her as the highest class of\nthreat to the preservation of their faith."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219600"
msgid "T-they're being way more vicious than they\nneed to be! What about #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's virtue!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219700"
msgid "I think it should be called \"magical powers\"\nat this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219760"
msgid "It was only for a brief time… just two months\nthat he was in contact with #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF,\nbut his nature truly became that of a saint."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1219912"
msgid "That resulted in the Church going after her.\nShe was betrayed by her faith and many people,\nand was denounced as a murderer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220040"
msgid "…okay. We're taking the wrong route by\nbringing Earth affairs into the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220140"
msgid "Well, yeah. But, while I partially agree,\nI think #C236196003Kiara#CDEF is different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220228"
msgid "That girl there's an airhead.\nShe has no clue how much she drives\neveryone around her insane."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220324"
msgid "The nickname she got stuck with,\n\"The Devilish Bodhisattva,\" really sums her up.\nWhy is that, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220444"
msgid "Please refrain from making\nunnecessary contact with her from now on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220516"
msgid "When I came to, I was in front of the cherry blossom tree."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220576"
msgid "It felt like I spent years in the Imaginary Number Space,\nbut simply being back here relaxes me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220676"
msgid "Although, I never would've dreamed that the day would come\nwhen I'd get \"nostalgic\" about this old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220784"
msgid "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF!\nI'm glad you made it back in one piece."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220848"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and the others are gathered in the schoolyard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220940"
msgid "I can see the same fatigue in all of their faces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1220992"
msgid "It's as if they had each escaped some peril,\nand came here to check up on one another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221080"
msgid "Not \"as if,\" that's exactly what happened,\napparently. I'm sure you also had a rough time,\nbut we were in a pinch, ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221208"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF became #C236196003BB#CDEF's stooge and ambushed us.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, and I were in the Student Council\nRoom, and we were on the verge of death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221404"
msgid "After that, because #C236196003Sakura#CDEF had collapsed,\nthe old school's barrier was lifted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221500"
msgid "And of course, that's when hostile programs from\nthe Labyrinth invaded, and NPCs in the school\nwere systematically attacked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221628"
msgid "…so that's how it went down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221660"
msgid "The old school is protected by #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nYour average hostile program can't enter,\nand even #C236196003BB#CDEF can only affect us by \"observing the inside.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221832"
msgid "However, the Masters #C236196003Sakura#CDEF regards as the\n\"subjects of her guardianship\" are different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1221940"
msgid "#C236196003Julius#CDEF, a Master, returned to the old school, \nrendered #C236196003Sakura#CDEF powerless, and lifted the barrier.\nHe attacked #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF, and then ushered hostile programs\ninto the mayhem-afflicted building to gain control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222216"
msgid "On #C236196003BB#CDEF's command, he commandeered this space\nin just a few minutes, but still――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222316"
msgid "Externally, it looked like #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and\nthe NPCs were on the verge of death,\nbut the damage they took wasn't fatal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222448"
msgid "Then, #C236196003Rani#CDEF and I were pushed into\nthe Imaginary Number Space,\nand everyone else was left in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222572"
msgid "That's all that happened.\nEveryone managed to find their own way back\nand got here just now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222668"
msgid "…what about you two?\nWe were able to monitor up until #C236196003Leo#CDEF\nwas defeated, but what happened after that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222788"
msgid "I explained to #C236196003Rin#CDEF\nthe sequence of events up until this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1222868"
msgid "About how #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Gawain#CDEF are gone.\nAbout how #C236196003Julius#CDEF saved me in his final moments."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223000"
msgid "And also about how #C236196003BB#CDEF's true goal is\nto head to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223104"
msgid "………I see.\nIt's a shame what happened to #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223196"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF's thoughts on the matter end there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223252"
msgid "I didn't expect her to give no response on #C236196003BB#CDEF's motive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223324"
msgid "What, about how she's heading for the\n#C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF? Well, I was already thinking\nthat might happen in the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223456"
msgid "The absolute worst case scenario I assumed\ncame to be. That's it.\nIt's scary, but not surprising."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223556"
msgid "It sounds like #C236196003Rin#CDEF had predicted, roughly,\nwhat \"#C236196003BB#CDEF ultimately had her eyes on.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223672"
msgid "No wonder she's the Student Council Vice President.\nShe's as reliable as a person can be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223764"
msgid "Though, I didn't think her goal would be\nsomething like \"a world where desires are\nunleashed.\" That's one awful future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1223884"
msgid "We can't stand here being gloomy all day.\nI'll light a fire under everyone's ass and\nget us reorganized. You go get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224012"
msgid "…I don't know what happened to you\nand I won't ask,\nbut your internals are all shattered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224104"
msgid "You're holding up for now, but I can tell\nyou're cobbled together. You're so mangled,\nI'm impressed you can still think rationally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224236"
msgid "…I'm surprised.\nApparently, for someone with #C236196003Rin#CDEF's level of observation,\nthey can easily catch on to how wounded my body is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224380"
msgid "I'm not hurting anymore,\nbut if #C236196003Rin#CDEF is telling me to rest, then I should rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224476"
msgid "To those who are in good health, she says \"go fight.\"\nAnd to those who must rest, she says \"go rest.\"\nPointing out the difference is #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's kindness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224652"
msgid "Have you made your preparations?\nWe're ready to take position and back you up."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1224732"
msgid "All right, let's go!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224756"
msgid "Got it. Alright, let's have you dive\ninto the world of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224844"
msgid "Understood. I'll guide you into the world\nof #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind, President #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1224956"
msgid "If you go in unprepared, we're all doomed.\nWe're on full standby until you're ready."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225044"
msgid "More prudence is needed from you today\ncompared to your usual explorations.\nBe fully prepared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225140"
msgid "By the way, about that recent Psycho Dive:\nwhat did you think about being inside #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225248"
msgid "Hey! #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF…!\nThe way you're saying it is,\nin many ways, um…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225328"
msgid "? Why are you getting so embarrassed?\nYou're an AI. Aren't you used to having your\ninternal structure investigated?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225444"
msgid "Is that so? Well, there are only a few #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF\nwho can hack one of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's advanced AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225596"
msgid "……… #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nI apologize for Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's rudeness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225684"
msgid "She has a tendency to be overly logical\nabout hacking. One could say she's\nprone to being more inhumane than us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225800"
msgid "Huh? This is no big deal for a #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND.\nWhy're you staring at me like that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1225924"
msgid "As you can see, she lacks delicacy. I'm still\nlearning about emotions, but Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nis an excellent teacher. Of what not to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226072"
msgid "Ah, I know what you mean.\nWhen I look at #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, I try to be more\nconscious about the hem of my skirt…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226196"
msgid "…you two get along really well, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226240"
msgid "…need something?\nAs you can see, I don't feel like talking.\nLeave me alone for a while."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226332"
msgid "Man, what is it?\nHave something you want to ask?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1226384"
msgid "…what's an \"Observed Universe\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226420"
msgid "Then be quiet! …ah, sorry.\nIt's terrible to lash out at an innocent person.\nBut honestly, I'm not very composed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226536"
msgid "#C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF…?\nAhh, I did explain something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226616"
msgid "\"Here, time doesn't pass.\nIf we were in a loop, we might've still\nhad a chance…\" Something like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226720"
msgid "But this situation is nothing like that kind of\nfar-fetched dream. We can't change the \"result\"\nthat occurred no matter what we do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1226852"
msgid "The #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF is a world made of\nImaginary Numbers. There IS a concept of time,\nbut how it works differs from reality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227000"
msgid "I suppose I should say it's the difference\nbetween \"perceived time\" and \"recorded time.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227092"
msgid "Look, we're talking about this right now\nin the present, right? But…\nOne, two, three…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227180"
msgid "There. Now what I said three seconds ago\nbecame \"the past.\" Even though we're still\nin the #ROFS0004#RUBSpresent#RUBEmiddle#REND of our conversation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227332"
msgid "This is the perceived flow of time.\nThrough humans' \"own perception,\" we separate\ntime and space into past, present, and future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227464"
msgid "#C000246204Observed Universes#CDEF have very simple laws of\nphysics. People can't see what comes after the\npresent, but they can influence the future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227616"
msgid "It's a bit late to mention this, but the real\nworld and the Near Side of the Moon are managed\nby this #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF. With me so far?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227772"
msgid "Basically, our world is the one with\n\"time that we perceive.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227836"
msgid "Humans perceive the \"past\" as\nconstantly updating into the \"present.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227908"
msgid "From that present, we observe the \"future\"\nwhich eventually comes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1227976"
msgid "But a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF's laws are different.\nA #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF is perceived from several\ndimensions above: a high dimensional entity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228148"
msgid "From the perspective of a higher dimension,\nthe third dimension looks like a flat scroll."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228240"
msgid "Umm, it's like if the 3-D world was a world\nprinted in a book, and you jumped from within\nthe book and landed outside the book."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228368"
msgid "You could then look down at the records\nof your past, present, and future that's in\nthe book whenever you wanted――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228488"
msgid "That's the perspective of a higher dimension.\nYou get it, right? With that being the case,\nall time within the book has equal value."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228624"
msgid "It's the same thing here.\nThis is an Imaginary Number Space, a higher\ndimensional data space made out of light."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228736"
msgid "The #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF is fundamentally\nmanaged through the laws of a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF,\nnot an #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1228904"
msgid "We're foreign matter… No, we're guests here.\nCreatures from an #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF\nthat got tossed into a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229060"
msgid "But, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's Core is a parallel world\nsimulator where past, present, and future exist\nsimultaneously, with all outcomes calculated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229216"
msgid "Basically, it's a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF entity.\nAnd now #C236196003BB#CDEF's become the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. She gained\nthe perspective of a higher dimension."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229396"
msgid "That's why――\n#C236196003BB#CDEF can manipulate the past and future\nat the same time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229484"
msgid "The moment #C236196003BB#CDEF reached the Core, she gained\nthe power to select a future and set it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229584"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF was purely the Eye of God.\nWith an AI like #C236196003BB#CDEF mixed in now,\nit's become the Brain of God."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229720"
msgid "I don't know what the future will look like in\na few hours, but either way, #C236196003BB#CDEF reached\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. That truth ISN'T changing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1229884"
msgid "She's now become a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF entity.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF can make facts retroactive. She can make it\nso that she knew \"this present\" would come."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230052"
msgid "…it's all pretty confusing.\nOnce #C236196003BB#CDEF became the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, she became able\nto tell her past self about \"this present.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230204"
msgid "\"Chasing after her as if we might make it in time somehow.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230264"
msgid "That act itself was futile.\nIt was decided from the beginning that\n#C236196003BB#CDEF would reach the Core in the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230384"
msgid "…anyway, that's how it is.\nIf you get it now, then be quiet for me.\nWe can't win against god."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230480"
msgid "If you're feeling restless, then how about\n#C000246204walking around the school#CDEF? It's safe, after all.\nWe're being kept in here like pets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230624"
msgid "…still need something? You need backup\nbecause you're going to the Labyrinth?\nYou're farming experience with your Servant?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230748"
msgid "…listen. Were you not paying attention\nto what we've been saying? It's pointless.\nAnything we do now is pointless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230864"
msgid "The life is draining from their faces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1230904"
msgid "More so than the fact that #C236196003BB#CDEF is far too powerful,\nthe fact that we've lost what we were trying to protect\nhas stolen their will to fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231060"
msgid "…I know how they feel.\nI was in the same state of mind not too long ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231136"
msgid "I can't force them to fight on against their will.\nHowever, their abilities will be vital\nif I want to enter the Central Region again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231272"
msgid "I need to somehow get them to help me,\neven if it's just getting me to where #C236196003BB#CDEF is――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231376"
msgid "Enough of this! You morons! Listening quietly\nto your nonsense is doing us no good! You call\nyourselves my #RUBS Praetor's#RUBEMaster's#REND women!? Pathetic!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231536"
msgid "Straighten yourselves up, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF!\nIs this how the top #RUBS   Magi#RUBE#C000246204Wizards#REND#CDEF of\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF act!? Pathetic!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231728"
msgid "Heads out of your asses, ladies!\nWhat's got you all so spineless!? This ain't\nno pinch for us, not by a long shot!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1231844"
msgid "Bah! How long will you stare at the floor, #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF!? Is this the miser and the observing\ndemon; Amazons who stood before me!? Fools!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232012"
msgid "――――Wha――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232028"
msgid "Battles are fought until you prevail! You may\nlose, your life may be taken―but if you won't\nrise up with indomitable will, then what!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232164"
msgid "This is the one time you SHOULD follow my\nexample! Fight until you've fallen thrice\nand risen thrice!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232268"
msgid "Your premise is all wrong, anyhow.\nYou say the future is fixed?\nWhat else is new!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232352"
msgid "People have no influence over the past or\nfuture. \"Changing the future\" was already\na ridiculous idea!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232456"
msgid "People have influence only over the present.\nHaven't you already proven that doing so\nresults in changing the future!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232576"
msgid "Listen. Our coming battles aren't pointless.\nActually―― There's no such thing as\n\"pointless battles\" when it comes to humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232704"
msgid "You stop because you see the end result. If it\nwere common sense to do so, human civilization\nwouldn't have developed as it has."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232836"
msgid "And most of all, #C236196003Rin#CDEF, #C236196003Rani#CDEF――\nYou're thinking about it all wrong."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1232936"
msgid "Sure, anything that's \"decided\" here in the Far\nSide is absolute. #C236196003BB#CDEF reached the Core.\nNothing can probably change that now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233080"
msgid "However―― You CAN add a new, small detail\nto that outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233144"
msgid "Things have no end. Something always continues\non after. Don't be misled by how things\nare in Imaginary Number Spaces."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233264"
msgid "Even under the laws of a higher dimension,\nbetween the present and future is the tiniest\nblank space where one can write in a sentence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233400"
msgid "\"The Moon was destroyed by a witch.\"\n\"However―― By the efforts of adamant youths,\nthe world was narrowly saved.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233516"
msgid "So.\nFor what purpose do your skills exist for?\nSo you can sit here and be at your wits' end?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233612"
msgid "Ahem.\nPlease don't look so down, you two.\nHold off on resignation for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233700"
msgid "I know I'm sticking my nose in, but that's why\nI'm going to go ahead and say this:\nwe haven't been defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233812"
msgid "Please look at Darling. No matter how many times\n#[he][she]# loses or runs, #[he][she]# nonchalantly survives\nand eventually brings about an upset."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1233960"
msgid "So long as we have someone who plays\ndirty like this, \"somehow always winning\nin the end,\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234052"
msgid "The present exists so we can do something about\nit. The future may be decided, but that doesn't\nmean you can't change the present!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234184"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF has fallen, certainly.\nThere was never any future in store for you all\nwhere you stopped that from happening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234332"
msgid "Isn't it natural? She crafted a premise\nwhere your \"victory\" was shut out,\nthen summoned you all here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234436"
msgid "So far, it's all as #C236196003BB#CDEF planned. You all merely\ndance in the palm of her hand. But, she doesn't\nknow of the slight irregularities inside her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234596"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's calculations end here. She intended to\nbring everything to a close with her victory and\nyour defeat―as the future had been set."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234748"
msgid "However. There remains some with will\nyet to fight… Fools who refuse to disappear,\nrather; who persist after defeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234868"
msgid "Your fated defeat can't be reversed.\nThat's one impossible request even I\ncan't grant. That is why――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1234972"
msgid "Get through the events set in stone, and all\nthat's left after is a blank page.\nThat's where your fight takes place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235092"
msgid "How presumptuous to think you can\nchange the future, anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235156"
msgid "#ROFS-009#RUBSThe present#RUBE\"Now\"#REND constantly passes, #ROFS-003#RUBSthe future#RUBE\"next\"#REND is a cloth\ncontinually woven in extension,\nand I am the eternal, undying King of Heroes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235348"
msgid "So long as I exist, there is no \"end.\" If you\nforesee a future of ruin, then change the nuance\nof the meaning, as when history is compiled!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235488"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's encouragement echoes throughout\nthe sullen Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235576"
msgid "It was as if a wave washed over us.\nThe tan girl is the first to regain herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235660"
msgid "――――That's true.\nAhh. I wonder why I didn't realize it sooner,\nit's so obvious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235744"
msgid "All #C236196003BB#CDEF did was decide the future.\nThe future might not be alterable,\nbut the present is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1235852"
msgid "After all―― The present is still our domain.\nIt's the one thing an #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF\nhas over a #C000246204Recorded Universe#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236004"
msgid "A familiar glint returns to the red girl's eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236056"
msgid "…I faintly recall something.\nIn the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, she lent me a hand many\ntimes despite us being enemies.\nShe was a worthy rival, brimming with life\nwho always sought to play fair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236256"
msgid "And even though I had said it myself once\nbefore: stopping #C236196003BB#CDEF isn't the objective\nof this fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236372"
msgid "That's right. The reason the future is decided\nis because a \"present where we defeated #C236196003BB#CDEF\"\ndoesn't exist here in the Far Side yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236520"
msgid "But if we can create that present, we can\ncreate a new possibility. The future will have\na different outcome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236632"
msgid "With two futures, the future that occurred\nhere will decouple with the present world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236720"
msgid "…to be honest, defeating #C236196003BB#CDEF might not make\na huge difference to the future at this point,\nfor all we know. Still――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1236856"
msgid "Still, a computational error WILL arise.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF will be eliminated, and the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will\nreturn to normal. That itself is worth it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237020"
msgid "Exactly.\nAt last you've regained\nyour previous sensibility!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237080"
msgid "Exactly.\nYou two really do have the right stuff."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237132"
msgid "Splendidly done鷙\n…honestly, making Darling fight alone is bit\nof a heavy burden for anyone to bear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237236"
msgid "…hmph. Look at me rallying these cretins\nback to their feet. So foolish.\nKnow that this is your fault, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237352"
msgid "Though this doesn't mean I've redeemed myself.\nFrom here on out, I'll be giving my\nall as an operator."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237456"
msgid "…I feel the same. We're the ones crafting\nthe strategies, yet we ended up becoming\na burden on you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237560"
msgid "\"I'll at least get sent to where #C236196003BB#CDEF is.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237620"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF are more outstanding #C000246204Magi#CDEF, fighters than I am."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237728"
msgid "Because they have superior judgement,\nthey were more realistic in discerning #C236196003BB#CDEF's\ncomparative strength and our situation,\nwhich overwhelmed them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237892"
msgid "They felt worry and anxiety magnitudes more than I did."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1237948"
msgid "…yeah. I knew full well how strong #C236196003BB#CDEF\nwas compared to us from the very beginning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238048"
msgid "\"We're no match for her.\" \"We can't do anything.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238100"
msgid "If reasons like that are stopping us in our tracks,\nthen we're not putting up much of a fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238196"
msgid "He knew that we would lose.\nHe knew we couldn't win."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238252"
msgid "Still―― He entrusted everything to\nsomeone who hadn't yet given up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238324"
msgid "Alright. So now we're facing two issues:\nThe first is that huge Labyrinth Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238404"
msgid "Yes. Without destroying that Core,\nwe can't reach the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF.\nIt truly is our final obstacle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238524"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?\nWearing a grave expression,\nshe returns to the Student Council Room from the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238640"
msgid "…#C000246204SGs#CDEF may be secrets,\nbut I don't think that makes them traumas…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238724"
msgid "Wait, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. If what you say is true,\nthen can you quickly do something about it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238824"
msgid "…………yes.\nEven I can destroy that wall.\nI know I didn't bring it up at the time…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1238912"
msgid "No, there was no helping it.\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's mental state was\nabnormal at the time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239012"
msgid "Hey, are you saying it's MY fault!?\nGah… Sure, yeah, it was my fault!\nThat huge thing was incredible, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239128"
msgid "So please, don't hesitate to\nremove that Labyrinth Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239188"
msgid "Please allow me one condition to open that door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239240"
msgid "I'm an AI that manages everyone's health and\nsafety. Technically, I have to oppose you all\ngoing off to fight a battle you can't win."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239376"
msgid "…I won't say anything more to stop you.\nI'll be aiding you in your fight, everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239464"
msgid "No. I can't approve as things stand now.\nWe need a countermeasure against #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nPlease find a way to disable her #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239620"
msgid "Once you do so, I'll open up the Labyrinth\nCore… #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind. That's the one and only\ncondition I have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239744"
msgid "So #C236196003Sakura#CDEF says,\nher eyes bearing determination."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239808"
msgid "\"#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF\"――\nShe has a point. Disabling that skill is the\nminimum we need to do. Let's start by consulting #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1239960"
msgid "Should we start the dive?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1239988"
msgid "Give me a little more time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240016"
msgid "Make it quick, okay?\nTime does hardly pass here,\nbut unforeseen forces could \"get it moving.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240112"
msgid "\"I'm all set.\"\nI reply to #C236196003Rin#CDEF that I'm ready whenever."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240184"
msgid "Then let's get started.\nWe'll have #C236196003#SVT#CDEF enter an idle state.\nAnd you'll take this, here:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240292"
msgid "It's been decided, so please just roll with it.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, are we ready?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240400"
msgid "I'm ready as well.\n#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, once you've dived in,\nhurry towards the center of your Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240520"
msgid "There will be a battle against my primal self,\nwhich even I know nothing of. …is there\nany way to avoid that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240632"
msgid "A \"me\" that even I know nothing about, huh…\nIs there any way to restrain this \"me\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240720"
msgid "I would like to ask something, just in case…\nIs there any way to restrain this cornerstone\n\"me,\" this #ROFS0006#RUBSanimal#RUBEprimal#REND \"me\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240868"
msgid "You can guess what will happen with my\nprototype. Just to be sure, is there no way to\navoid battle?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1240968"
msgid "It's probably not possible. To a \"#C000246204Mythical\nMystic Code#CDEF\"― the \"root,\" logic and instincts\nare a nuisance. I think battle is unavoidable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241124"
msgid "It's an origin that you have no knowledge of, so\nplease think of it as a different person… or\na phenomenon which shares only your looks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241264"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nWhile #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF is undertaking the mission,\nyou'll be able to do nothing but watch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241384"
msgid "…it's still a highly dangerous mission,\nbut you have no choice but to believe in us.\nPlease entrust this to us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241500"
msgid "…okay.\nYes, I've taken up time needlessly.\nI place my Praetor in your hands, #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241600"
msgid "I see, that makes sense.\nThen―― Please make use of my body.\nI place the life of my #RUBS Darling#RUBEMaster#REND in your hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241732"
msgid "Come, now. There's nothing to fret over. That\nman has a tendency to size up his enemies.\nHe won't take a mongrel seriously."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241856"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF entrusts #SVT[her][his][her][his]# body to #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1241944"
msgid "Looks like, in my case――#C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003Rin#CDEF will be handling me.\nThey will extract my soul from my digital frame,\nconvert it into an independent \"unit,\"\nthen send it into #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's \"soul.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242176"
msgid "Now, close your eyes. When the conversion\nstarts, I think you'll feel a bit squished,\nbut don't wiggle around too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242296"
msgid "Extracting soul from the body and mind.\nBeginning telepathy via the #C000246204Multi-Colored\nTranquility#CDEF―― #RUBS  Origin connect#RUBECore contact#REND, start!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242464"
msgid "Oh, yeah.\nYou mind giving me back the cube #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nis sealed in?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242544"
msgid "As the one who set that mechanism up,\nit's my responsibility to hold on to it."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1242624"
msgid "…about that―― Lancer is…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1242656"
msgid "…can you let me have this cube?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242692"
msgid "…it pains me to talk about it,\nbut I'll tell #C236196003Rin#CDEF about what happened:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242780"
msgid "About #C236196003Lancer#CDEF's magnificent heroism.\nAbout the end of the girl who dreamt of being\na diva up until the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1242908"
msgid "Huh? #C236196003Lancer#CDEF is still alive, against all odds.\nLooks like she's sleeping like a baby\nin the cube."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243024"
msgid "Th-then, after we parted so dramatically, she\nonly went back because she was tired!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243112"
msgid "Okay, I'll be taking this from you♪\nWah! What's going on!? Her bad karma\ndropped like crazy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243208"
msgid "Ugh… That means headaches for me… It's going\nto be hell taking care of this annoying girl\nwhen I'm an old lady…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243324"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF was magnificent up until the very end. \nIt wouldn't do her justice to sum up her bravery\nas resulting from \"her just being sad\"―\nEven if she WAS our enemy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243504"
msgid "You sure?\nI don't mind, but it's a big responsibility,\nyou know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243572"
msgid "It's a cursed item, see. Throwing it\naway willy-nilly will come back to bite you,\nand holding on to it lowers your luck."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243696"
msgid "Well, karma like hers won't go away in one or\neven two hundred years. That there will probably\nstay a box until you pass away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243824"
msgid "Hang in there.\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF may be powerful, but hey, I know\nyou'll make it through someway or another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1243940"
msgid "After all, that's how you've gotten\nall your wins up 'til now.\nI'm not worried. It's just that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244040"
msgid "I hate to put pressure on you,\nbut don't mess up in the final stretch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244112"
msgid "If we don't stop that AI, #C236196003BB#CDEF…\nwe won't be able to bounce back…\nThat's the feeling I'm getting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244228"
msgid "I told you, hurry off and get to your My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244276"
msgid "If #C236196003Sakura#CDEF was feeling well, I'd have her\ngive you a medical checkup, but she's getting\nrepairs right now. Can't use the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244424"
msgid "Wh-what is it…? You look like you haven't said\nenough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244484"
msgid "Prepare yourself for when we get back to the\nNear Side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244540"
msgid "*sigh*… If I had my #C236196003Lancer#CDEF with me, this \nwouldn't have happened…\nWhat a terrible blunder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244652"
msgid "Eh? \"What happened to that #C236196003blue Lancer#CDEF,\"\nyou ask?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244720"
msgid "Right about now he must be in the Near Side\nscratching his head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244788"
msgid "And only I was pulled into the #C000246204Far Side of the\nMoon#CDEF. If I don't get back quickly, he'll\nprobably run out of mana and disappear…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1244936"
msgid "The more of the Labyrinth's info you gather,\nthe easier it'll be for me to hack it.\nI'm counting on you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245064"
msgid "Hey. Incidentally, is that #C236196003Leo#CDEF over there the\nREAL #C236196003Leo#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245152"
msgid "You can change in My Room.\nWhy not try heading back and changing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245220"
msgid "I like my clothes, so I'll be staying like this.\nI've always wanted to wear a uniform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245308"
msgid "You can change clothes in My Room.\nGive it a try when you have other\noutfits to wear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245396"
msgid "Y-you can't go around wearing that!\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF may approve, but I don't!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245480"
msgid "At last, the third and final #C000246204SG#CDEF. Hmhmhm.\nWhatever sort of secret it is, I'm going to\ndrag it out into the sunlight―― Just watch!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245628"
msgid "Ah! #C236196003#NICK#CDEF!\nH-how long were you standing there!?\nAhahahaha. N-nice weather today, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245732"
msgid "A secret even she doesn't realize she has…\nIs it possible, considering it's #C236196003Rani#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245832"
msgid "Jeeeez! How are we supposed to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF in\nher domain!? Let us try something WE'RE good\nat, come on!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1245952"
msgid "Eh? What's my strong suit? Umm… Ch-Chinese\ncooking, and cyber terrorism, and money systems,\nand yeah, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246068"
msgid "Good work. I never thought #C236196003Jinako#CDEF would get\nthe third #C000246204SG#CDEF for us. I'm surprised."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246180"
msgid "At any rate, \"#C000246204Powergamer#CDEF,\" huh… Pfft.\nWhat kind of a naming sense is that?\nIt's no wonder #C236196003Rani#CDEF is pissed off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246324"
msgid "Just hearing that broadcast makes\nme tense up, you know…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246384"
msgid "By the way, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF. What kind of food\ndo you like? Wanna try having a cooking battle\nbetween us later?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246504"
msgid "About #C236196003Kiara#CDEF, I don't really get along with\nher, or rather, we're not very compatible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246608"
msgid "It's not that I don't like her or anything. It's\njust that our ways of life are different in too\nmany ways. It's hard to approach her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246744"
msgid "…hey. Now WHY do I get the feeling\nyou're looking at my chest? You think different\nmeans in terms of \"size,\" eh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246860"
msgid "Alright, kneel down. Then repent. If you keep\nup the sexual harassment, I'll skin you alive\nand toss you into the Styx鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1246984"
msgid "Eh? You understand? I'm so glad! It sort of\nfeels like we're tight-knit now―― Hey. \nWhy do I feel your gaze on my chest?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247108"
msgid "…yeah, they do.\nThat's why the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF exists.\nIt was dumb of me to ask."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247208"
msgid "Her chest is her #C000246204SG#CDEF… Her chest being an #C000246204SG#CDEF…\nThere's SO much showing already, how can\nit even be a secret!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247352"
msgid "If they're such a bother, why not share\nwith people who could use some!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247428"
msgid "Huh? You want to know what I'm talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247476"
msgid "Don't keep asking the obvious.\nIf you keep pretending to be thickheaded,\nI really will kill you, hear me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247584"
msgid "Good work. At least this #C000246204SG#CDEF was an\neasy one to get as well. Keep it up for\nthe next one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247692"
msgid "Although… About all the problems, outside of\ngetting the #C000246204SG#CDEF, all I can really do is give you\nmy condolences. Try your best, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247844"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF! Phew, I'm glad you're back in\none piece. Thinking about the worst happening\nto you makes me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1247964"
msgid "Without you, we'd have no one to\nexplore the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, okay?\nThat's all I meant! Really, that's ALL!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248092"
msgid "Pester me anymore, and I'll spread a virus\nacross the Labyrinth that melts only clothes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248184"
msgid "Going with the essentially unreasonable #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nor the punishment of being with #C236196003Gatou#CDEF.\nIn a sense, it's the ultimate decision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248344"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is surprisingly normal, huh?\nA lot like you, don't you think, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248452"
msgid "You don't get what I mean? Oh, come on～\nIt doesn't mean anything～ I wasn't thinking\nanything like \"couple of bores.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248572"
msgid "You must be worried about things, but get\nsome rest, first. We'll do as much as we\ncan in the meantime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248676"
msgid "You're up against an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\nStrong, but not someone you can't necessarily\nbeat. Do your best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248792"
msgid "You alright, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?\nAre your memories jumbled up in any way?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248872"
msgid "Me…?\nI'm okay. I'm not the delicate type that\nloses her cool over something like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1248960"
msgid "I don't get why #C236196003Leo#CDEF, as neatly perfect as he is,\nis so indifferent when it comes to a woman's\nheart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249080"
msgid "He probably didn't have people around him who\nwould teach him about that sort of thing,\nrather than it just being his personality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249212"
msgid "But now I think about it, he does have #C236196003Julius#CDEF\nwith him, who's very down-to-earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249312"
msgid "Huh? You never realized that?\nIt's just that he has a poker face.\nYou'd be surprised how much he reacts to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249420"
msgid "Well, if he were any more delicate with women,\nhe'd be perfect to the point of being creepy.\nHow he is now may be just right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249548"
msgid "Goofs are way more dangerous than folks\nof conviction. That's because they have\nno self-awareness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249648"
msgid "I don't get along with saint-type people\nin the first place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249712"
msgid "I think she ACTUALLY has some screws\nloose somewhere. Serving others without\nany reward, really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249812"
msgid "And that's why, though being suspicious of her\nis a little extreme, we should be careful\nto not trust #C236196003Kiara#CDEF too much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1249948"
msgid "Too much of a good thing is bad for you. If you\nget too used to people being nice to you,\nyou start turning soft, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250072"
msgid "Hehehehe.\nWe've got that damn #C236196003BB#CDEF by the neck, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250140"
msgid "Just you wait!\nPayback just got an interest hike――\nMy thanks for messing with us at your whimsy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250240"
msgid "I told you, hurry off and get to your My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250288"
msgid "If #C236196003Sakura#CDEF was feeling well, I'd have her\ngive you a medical checkup, but she's getting\nrepairs right now. Can't use the Infirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250436"
msgid "I know it's been tough recently, but…\nUltimately, you have to go to the Labyrinth and\nget the #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF. That hasn't changed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250600"
msgid "Give it your best, our new President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250640"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's invitation is pretty much a trap.\nDon't let your guard down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250732"
msgid "Keep in mind―― You can't eat something that's\nnot food, even if the person that made it\ninsists they made it with love. Capiche?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250864"
msgid "It dealt THAT much damage just from its purely\nawful flavor? It's extraordinary, in one\nsense… I wonder what spices she used…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1250992"
msgid "What surprises me even more is that even after \nall that damage you took, you're good as new,\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251112"
msgid "What's the deal with your stomach?\nLet us #RUBS   scan#RUBEanalyze#REND you thoroughly later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251208"
msgid "HUH? She ran away? What's going on!?\nWe're fine here, hurry and #C000246204go after her#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251304"
msgid "Well, most importantly, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF came out fine. \nWe also got #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF out of the way.\nThings turned out alright."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251448"
msgid "So, what was it like inside #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251500"
msgid "I know.\nJust kidding. It was just a joke."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251544"
msgid "It's normal to tease #[girls][boys]# you're interested in.\nYou've done it before, right, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251656"
msgid "You must be tuckered out after today.\n#C000246204How about going back to My Room and resting#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251756"
msgid "Me? Ahh, yeah.\nAfter I wrap this last thing up,\nI guess I'll hit the hay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251832"
msgid "I'll finish this up quick and\nhave myself that shower."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1251888"
msgid "Ah, before I forget. If by any chance you happen\nto peek or something, I'll mod all the #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF exits to \"forbid egress\"鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252036"
msgid "You probably don't remember, but you have\na history of peeking around.\nA shock won't cut it this time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252140"
msgid "If you'd like, how about we go in together?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252184"
msgid "Huh? You want to know what I was\ntalking to #C236196003Rani#CDEF and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF about?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252284"
msgid "Like hell I'm going to say it in front\nof other people!!! Especially in front of you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252372"
msgid "When three girls get together to talk,\nit can only be about one thing, right?\nRomance, always romance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252476"
msgid "But both #C236196003Rani#CDEF and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF are clueless when\nit comes to that stuff… I'm not going to\nhassle them over it, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252624"
msgid "I was kind of hoping to see whose memory it\nwas about… Hmm, it feels like I got\nmy hopes up for nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252732"
msgid "We know what causes her invincibility, but the\nway to destroy it is more than just difficult.\nWe may as well call it a gamble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252860"
msgid "Why's it gotta be invincibility, anyway!?\nShe better be putting up her wallet if she\nwants a pass on cheats like that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1252980"
msgid "This will be the last time we work together.\nYou'll enter #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's mind and beat her.\nThen you'll bust into the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253148"
msgid "Just do what you always do and you'll win,\nno sweat. Don't get overeager, just stay cool."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253240"
msgid "Now I'm kind of relieved.\nFeels like I'm overflowing with motivation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253312"
msgid "Yep, yep鷙\nMoney really does make the world go round!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253368"
msgid "Wh-what!?\nIt's no big deal―― I do like money, after all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253428"
msgid "Hehehehehe. Time to show us how slick\nof a#RUBS      Magus#RUBE#C000246204 negotiator#CDEF#REND you are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253536"
msgid "If you have anything left to take care of,\ngo get it done now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253600"
msgid "I guess all I have left to do is clean up\nthe Student Council Room and the room I've been\nusing. Then it's bedtime for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253724"
msgid "Alright, meeting adjourned.\nI'm in private mode now.\nWe'll pick this back up tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253812"
msgid "Oh?\n#C236196003#NICK#CDEF, you're back in our old uniform."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253872"
msgid "Hm? I don't have much to say about it.\nI've seen plenty of that uniform.\nBut… you know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1253964"
msgid "When I just sit and look you over, I think…\nNo, I thought this way before, too.\nYou're rather good looking…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254076"
msgid "Ah, what am I even saying!? \nI have nothing to say, nothing!\nGo get your ass in that Labyrinth already!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254180"
msgid "Wha―― That you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!?\nOh thank God, finally someone who gets\nwhat I'm talking about!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254288"
msgid "As soon as he sees me, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's face starts to glow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254360"
msgid "He's barely said anything yet,\nbut just from his gestures I could tell that he's the\nsame #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF I saw in the \"previous school building.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254520"
msgid "Even if that \"previous school building\" was a dream I had,\nthe actors in that dream were projections of those\nthat had I met in the \"real preliminaries.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254676"
msgid "It's safe to say that this #C236196003Shinji#CDEF has\nthe same personality as I remember."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254768"
msgid "So, same thing for you? When you came to,\nyou found yourself in this school building?\nHey, have you seen any sort of exit?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254892"
msgid "I answer #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's question with a shake of my head."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1254960"
msgid "I explained that I had just woken up in this\nold school building, so I had yet to see an exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255056"
msgid "Shinji talks the same way he usually does."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255100"
msgid "I know he's saying rude things,\nbut I don't feel any animosity towards him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255176"
msgid "It looks like I've gotten TOO used to his\nelitism and self-consciousness from my dream."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255264"
msgid "…also, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF really IS brilliant, despite how he looks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255340"
msgid "Just like #C236196003Leo#CDEF asked of me,\nlet's try scouting him for the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255432"
msgid "Huh? Student Council?\nTeam up and work together so we can\nescape from here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255508"
msgid "Ha! No way! A Student Council isn't worth\na damn. If everyone wants to get all chummy\nto escape, then go right on ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255632"
msgid "I'm a genius, you know.\nI don't work with commoners.\nI won't ask for anyone's help, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255724"
msgid "More importantly, this is the first I've\nheard of #C236196003Leo#CDEF being here! I despise that guy.\nSo smug. All cool and calm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255856"
msgid "If #C236196003Leo#CDEF got the boot and I'd be made President,\nI'd consider it. Until then,\ndon't come to me for anything, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1255988"
msgid "…he ended up rejecting me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256016"
msgid "But just what does #C236196003Shinji#CDEF\nthink he's going to do all on his own?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256100"
msgid "I know he's not great at making friends,\nbut I don't think it's smart to act tough\nin a situation like this…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256212"
msgid "Let's put that aside. #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF,\ndo you remember the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256312"
msgid "I answer by saying that I can't recall anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256364"
msgid "I feel like I made it through several rounds with my Servant,\nbut so long as I don't know \"who\" or \"how\" I fought,\nI have nothing to tell #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256528"
msgid "The only real feeling I have left\nis the firm bond I have with #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256616"
msgid "I answer by saying that I can't recall anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256668"
msgid "I feel like I made it through several rounds with my Servant,\nbut so long as I don't know \"who\" or \"how\" I fought,\nI have nothing to tell #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256832"
msgid "Obviously, being a Master and all, I reply.\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's astonishment was closer to fear than confusion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1256952"
msgid "…yeah, sort of, I answer with little confidence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257004"
msgid "…gone. Apparently, we got separated\non the way here. Well, once I return to the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, she'll come back to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257144"
msgid "…that's right, I need to hurry up and get back\nto the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.#RUBS         I'm#RUBE Her Master's#REND not there.\nThat woman must be lonely in some dumb way…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257328"
msgid "Besides, I'm sure the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's still on.\nIf you're not on the final battlefield in\nseven days, you lose by default, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257476"
msgid "A #C000246204seven day period#CDEF…\nA #C000246204final battlefield#CDEF… \nA #C000246204loss by absence#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257588"
msgid "When I heard that, I remembered it too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257628"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF is a tournament with seven rounds.\nFirst, an opponent is decided for you.\nAfter seven days of preparation,\nyou go to the final battlefield and fight the enemy Master.\nThose are the rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257852"
msgid "Naturally, losing this fight means elimination.\nNot reaching the final battlefield is also \"defeat.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1257956"
msgid "Ridiculous. Worst comes to worst,\nall you have to do is log out.\nIt's an old scare tactic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258048"
msgid "Sure, that could be how the final selection\nof the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF is.\nWorst comes to worst, you can just drop your connection\nand return to your body on Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258224"
msgid "…however, they say that not a single #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND who\nwent up to the Moon has ever returned from that cyberspace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258380"
msgid "And――The real problem is that we're\nin this school building, unable to get out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258464"
msgid "W-what's with that gloomy look on your face!?\nThere's probably just no connection\nbetween here and the surface."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258576"
msgid "What? The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is a Brain of God, right?\nThen it'll help us soon enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258672"
msgid "You're so damn persistent.\nA friendly little Student Council isn't\nmy thing. Can't you bother someone else?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258780"
msgid "…like I thought,\nit sounds like #C236196003Shinji#CDEF has no intention of joining either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258872"
msgid "I'm sure I've already looked around the\nschool building from top to bottom,\nbut I haven't gotten very good responses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1258992"
msgid "Let's stop by the Student Council Room to report to #C236196003Leo#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259068"
msgid "First, we visit the Student Council.\nIf we all come up with another plan,\na way to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF may arise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259188"
msgid "Or rather, we'll find a way.\nThough it's only chess, losing over and over\ngoes against every fiber of my being!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259300"
msgid "About our issue with #C236196003Rani#CDEF: what if we challenge\nher to a game other than chess? I'm confident\nthat I'm second to none in Hanafuda…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259448"
msgid "Did we have games with pieces back in\nancient Uruk, you ask? The answer is obvious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259532"
msgid "All of humanity's intellectual property, from\nall origins, come from my stores. That #C236196003King of\nConquerors#CDEF' library only imitates mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259684"
msgid "Heeeeeeeey!\nIt SURE DOES look like my time to shine, huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259744"
msgid "Ah! #C236196003Shinji#CDEF…!?\nWhere did you come from…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259804"
msgid "I was here the whole time!\nDo you know how many minutes\nI've been waiting here!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259888"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF, you… were waiting for me,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1259988"
msgid "Why on Earth―― Well, that's what I would say,\nbut it's not really that strange.\nMaybe he was spying on the Student Council again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260120"
msgid "Hmph――! I heard about it from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF? Chess? How no one could beat her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260232"
msgid "Hmph――! I heard about it from #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF? Chess? How no one could beat her?\nAh, except for #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260388"
msgid "I don't feel like joining in on your\npointless floundering, but I can't just\nignore a classmate in trouble, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260508"
msgid "It won't hurt to show off what this\nNo. 1 Game Champ of Asia is made of.\nI'll lend you a hand, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260628"
msgid "Oh my. I sense an indescribable vigor from this\nman… Listen, Praetor. Could this be the first\ntime he's been useful in his entire life?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260768"
msgid "…I won't give him points for eavesdropping,\nbut it's good that he volunteered to cooperate.\nLet's see what he's got, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1260900"
msgid "――――Hm.\nThough minuscule, I felt #ROFS0001#RUBSkingliness#RUBEan aura#REND……\nCould this \"#C236196003Shinji#CDEF\" be the King of Buffoons?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261044"
msgid "Hmph. As usual, your Servant always\nhas something to say. Just you wait and see―\nthis time I'll show you how awesome I am…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261172"
msgid "…hey, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nHave your Servant and I\never spoken to each other before?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261260"
msgid "Hey now, that Servant of yours\nhas a real sharp set of eyes on him!\nHe's all golden and looks tough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261364"
msgid "…whatever. Anyway, go on over to #C236196003Rani#CDEF.\nI'll be on standby in\nthe Student Council Room, got it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261480"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is full of energy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261524"
msgid "Let's trust in the Game Champ's skills\nand try challenging #C236196003Rani#CDEF once again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261616"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF is standing in front of the room.\nBy the looks of it,\nit seems he wants to talk to me about something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261744"
msgid "Ever since the whole affair with #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF,\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF has become increasingly obstinate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261864"
msgid "I wonder what #C236196003Shinji#CDEF wants to talk to me about,\nin spite of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1261948"
msgid "#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's been keeping me in the loop.\nYou saw just how outclassed you are,\nyet you still went into HER Labyrinth, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262084"
msgid "Not only did she treat me like a worm,\nshe even went and nano-sized me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262160"
msgid "If you had left me there, I'd be\nliquid nutrients for that #ROFS0002#RUBSSakura#RUBE#C236196003AI#CDEF#REND right about now.\nThinking about it makes me shudder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262324"
msgid "…so, how'd it go?\nYou entered her Labyrinth, so you fought her,\nright? Show me your battle logs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262424"
msgid "He doesn't know about #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's\nfighting style or her #C000246204invincibility#CDEF skill."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262536"
msgid "How about we show him our previous data?\nThis man is a rather persistent one.\nHe'll keep asking and asking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262644"
msgid "Please show him our last battle records.\nWe might even get… probably nothing out of it,\nconsidering it's this guy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262760"
msgid "*sigh* We haven't a single grain of obligation\nto tell you anything, but having you follow us\naround is SO annoying… Go ahead, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1262900"
msgid "It would clearly be in vain to do so, but\nthere's always a possibility. If all he desires\nis the battle data, then give it to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263032"
msgid "Urged on by #C236196003#SVT#CDEF,\nI share my impressions of the time we were assaulted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263120"
msgid "Huh…?\nI knew about Drain, but what's up with that\n\"#C000246204Invincibility#CDEF\"? Is she really invincible?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263232"
msgid "I can at least say that she nullified\neverything we threw at her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263300"
msgid "Maybe she just has high defense,\nand if we get our attack stat up, we can break through…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263392"
msgid "…all we can do is hope that's the case\nand head to the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263460"
msgid "You've got some guts heading into\nthe Labyrinth with her after you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263532"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF both have awful personalities,\nbut SHE'S even worse than awful. You'll get\nslaughtered without mercy if she finds you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263704"
msgid "And you're going to beat THAT?\nDid #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and the others come up\nwith some sort of strategy?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263816"
msgid "They're coming up with one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263844"
msgid "But the hole #C236196003Leo#CDEF left behind is a big one.\nAll the work keeps piling up solely on #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1263988"
msgid "I have no choice but to find a countermeasure\nfor #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF within the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264088"
msgid "…unbelievable.\nAre you seriously not scared? You do realize\nwe have no chance of winning, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264188"
msgid "Yet you're still going to defy #C236196003BB#CDEF?\n…the Near Side of the Moon\nain't that great a place, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264304"
msgid "The #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF was an actual slaughterfest.\nEven if we make it back,\nwe'll either live or die. That's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264432"
msgid "I don't hear any of the usual bravado in #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264508"
msgid "In his own way, he's speaking his mind.\nHe's expressing his raw apprehensions without any pretense."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1264608"
msgid "I still have to get back to the Near Side."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1264652"
msgid "…to be honest, I'm scared too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264688"
msgid "…it's not that you want to go back,\nit's that you have to…\nWhat's the deal with you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264776"
msgid "You're just #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWhen did you start walking around,\nacting like a hero?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264868"
msgid "That stuff about the end of humanity?\nIt's a load of bull.\nShe's totally just talking it up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1264964"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is fundamentally the same as #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, right?\nSo it's fine. No way she's capable of\ndoing something that heinous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265112"
msgid "That's right, you should be.\nYou're up against a monster out to dominate\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. No one can blame us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265240"
msgid "You wouldn't be you otherwise, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF!\nThe fate of the world, protecting the Moon――\nIt's got nothing to do with us!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265376"
msgid "…looks like my answer didn't get through to #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265448"
msgid "No matter what I say,\nthere are no words that will make #C236196003Shinji#CDEF feel better."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265540"
msgid "That's something every person left in the\nold school building has in common, not just #C236196003Shinji#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265652"
msgid "The ones remaining are those who stifle such thoughts\nand struggle on, and those who can no longer struggle on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265764"
msgid "A-anyway, that's all I wanted to talk about.\nI want nothing to do with all this pointless\nfloundering about you're all doing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1265892"
msgid "I just got―you know―a bone to pick with HER.\nI was curious about what's been going on.\nThat's all this was, really!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266012"
msgid "…you heard me? DON'T.\nIf you value your life, then do nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266076"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF leaves, like he was holding back his frustration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266152"
msgid "…don't go into the Labyrinth.\nIf we just stick to the old school building, we'll be safe…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266244"
msgid "…it's absurd to imagine, but:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266276"
msgid "maybe if we did as she said, our situation\nwouldn't have changed, and no one would've disappeared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266376"
msgid "It would've been like sleeping in an empty cradle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266428"
msgid "We wouldn't have known about the outside world's destruction.\nMaybe we would've slept as much as we wanted\nwithin this sunset school forever――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266576"
msgid "But I've seen #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF go through\nthe cherry tree with that dinky face of #[his][hers]#.\nI need some info, stat…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266704"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's in front of the Student Council Room.\nHe's trying to peek inside by looking for gaps in the curtains\none-by-one, unaware that I'm standing right behind him."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1266888"
msgid "Your face looks as sorry as ever, #[huh][doesn't it]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1266944"
msgid "\"Why?\" you ask……\nI AM involved in the Student Council,\nso of course I'd come through here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267040"
msgid "And why're you here, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF?\nCould it be that you relate with #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C000246204SG1#CDEF?\nSo, despite speaking ill of the Student Council,\nyou're actually interest――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267240"
msgid "I mean, giving up on someone as uber talented\nas me after getting rejected one time?\nStudent Council messed up big time there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267368"
msgid "Like, do you really think I'M obligated\nto help them in any way? After all,\nthis problem'll go away if I just wait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267484"
msgid "That's why I'm only keeping an eye on you guys\nso you don't do anything excessive."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267568"
msgid "I see……\nWould've been great if #C236196003Shinji#CDEF joined the Student Council,\nbut if he doesn't want to, he doesn't want to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267700"
msgid "Guess I'll keep doing whatever I can,\njust like I always have."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267764"
msgid "How could you accept that so easily?\nCan't you…… do better than that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267840"
msgid "You really are a dunce, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI really wanna see how you go about\ngetting your Student Council business done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1267968"
msgid "Dumbass―― That wasn't what I…!\nSarcasm! That was SARCASM!\nDon't you get it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268048"
msgid "Arrrgh, whatever! No matter how many times\nyou invite me, it's not like I'd ever join\nyour little Student Council! Never ever!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268176"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF left while shouting at me.\n……I feel that somewhere in his heart,\nhe's got something similar to that aspect of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268336"
msgid "If I ever get stuck when I'm looking around,\nI might be able to ask #C236196003Shinji#CDEF for advice…… I think."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268452"
msgid "Money? Come on #[man][girl]#,\nI already told you I wasn't gonna help out!\nWhy would I start handing out money?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268564"
msgid "Besides, I'm the one strapped for some cash!\nI can't use my #RUBS  PPT#RUBEmoney#REND from the Near Side,\nand I can't find any extra memory anywhere!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268716"
msgid "I don't have a Servant, so it'd be ridiculous\nfor me to start farming mats!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268792"
msgid "…huff, huff… I did it…\nI was right all along… It takes a genius\nto know a genius… That's how it is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268900"
msgid "Now I can survive…\nThis'll end without me dying…\nNo, if I pull this off, I can…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1268984"
msgid "S-sorry about that. Just thinking about\nsome things. Looks like you're doing alright.\nYou insisted on surviving, again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269104"
msgid "So, what are you all going to do now?\nYou were calling it the \"Student Council,\"\nbut #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Julius#CDEF got done in, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269256"
msgid "There's no way out of this now, right?\nAll you, #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, and #C236196003Rani#CDEF can do now\nis whatever #C236196003BB#CDEF says."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269404"
msgid "How about accepting it and preparing for\nher recommendation to surrender? Ya never know,\nshe might spare you, if you're lucky."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269532"
msgid "……#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF? She should still be in the #C000246204garden#CDEF.\nGo meet her if you want."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269640"
msgid "In the first place, only second-rates\nhang out in stuff like Student Councils.\nI'll show you how I do things on my own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269760"
msgid "When the time comes to escape,\nI'll do you a favor and call out only to you,\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Be thankful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1269876"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF is also here in this school#REND, right?\nMaybe I'll pay her a visit later.\nI'm a bit worried, see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270004"
msgid "Huh? You're going to the Arena?\nThe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? You're able to go in\nthrough the schoolyard's cherry tree?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270136"
msgid "So #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF is the culprit\nbehind this weird situation, right?\nMan, what the hell is she doing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270248"
msgid "Don't tell me, was she so scared of losing\nto me that she ran from the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF?\nAww, that's actually kinda cute!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270384"
msgid "Ohh, #C000246204SG#CDEF, huh? Making walls in the Labyrinth\nout of the walls in people's hearts?\nWhat kind of shady joke is that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270516"
msgid "It's fine to ignore stuff like other people's\nfeelings. If there's an impassable wall,\nwhy not just smash it to pieces?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270636"
msgid "I met with #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF.\nI'm glad that she's alright.\nYeah, Teach's as nice as ever……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270740"
msgid "…hmph. Couldn't find an exit\nno matter how hard I searched.\nBut help should be coming soon, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270840"
msgid "No way would the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF abandon me.\nOnly idiots run around risking their lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1270940"
msgid "Then again, fussing over things like that\nis just like you, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271032"
msgid "What's up with that damn #C236196003BB#CDEF…!?\nThe nerve to hack our five senses and tout\nher shitty AI self as someone important…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271168"
msgid "Shit, I can't stop shaking……\n'cause of that violent hack,\nI still can't feel my arms n' legs yet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271272"
msgid "She honestly thinks she can make\na fool out of me! If I just had #C236196003Rider#CDEF,\nI'd blow that bitch away!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271388"
msgid "And what's with \"#C236196003Mr. Shinji-boy#CDEF,\" huh?\nShe making fun of me!?\nI'd rather she just picked one!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271500"
msgid "Pfft. That's great.\nYou'll be needing my help soon, I'm guessing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271568"
msgid "She called herself #C236196003Matou#CDEF all on her own.\nShe's not my little sister or anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271668"
msgid "…I guess she is pretty quiet and\nunderstanding. It's not like I hate her type…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271752"
msgid "But, uh, isn't she a little scary?\nLike she's a landmine, or has a scary smile…?\nAnyways, I'm not related to her!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271868"
msgid "This uniform? Yeah, when I came to\nI was in this uniform. Probably got it\naround the time I arrived in this school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1271984"
msgid "Since it's got the same performance,\nI don't really care if the design is different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272072"
msgid "But… I never wore anything like a uniform\nuntil I joined the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272168"
msgid "…h-hmmph. Having fun, aren't you\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF? #C000246204Habit of Exposure#CDEF, huh…\nIt's a very \"adult\" taste…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272296"
msgid "Huh!? N-nah, I just happened to overhear it!\nI don't even go near the Student Council Room,\nokay!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272396"
msgid "Hmph. Keeping your nose on the grindstone, huh?\nYou being a pleb and all,\nhonest, hard work is right up your alley."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272512"
msgid "Will the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF come to save us first,\nor will you guys clear the Labyrinth first?\nI'll be watching to see what happens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272652"
msgid "But just you wait. No doubt that, one day,\nI'll give her a run for her money in chess!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272740"
msgid "Hehe. My father taught me how to play chess\nwhen I was five years old."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272812"
msgid "At last, it's time for the main act.\nTHAT means it's #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF's turn.\nI'll show you what I can do!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1272932"
msgid "…in the end,\nno one was able to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF at chess, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273008"
msgid "…in the end,\nno one was able to beat #C236196003Rani#CDEF at chess, right?\nAh, other than #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273136"
msgid "…don't finish your sentence, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nYou need my help, right?\nI'll do it, I'll play some chess."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273252"
msgid "…the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF still isn't coming, huh…\nCould it be…\nIt's really not coming to save us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273360"
msgid "Shit…! That \"#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF\"\ndoesn't give a damn even if you're outside\nthe Student Council Room!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273472"
msgid "Ugh… Sorry, I feel awful right now…\nNever even got nauseous when I was playing\n3D FPS games…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273568"
msgid "Things are looking real dodgy now…\nYou really gonna be alright? If it's too much,\nisn't this a good time to throw in the towel?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273700"
msgid "W-well, whatever. Do what you want.\nYou're all hogging the Student Council Room,\nso it's your job to find the exit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273816"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF's skill can open up Shields in\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, right? I knew #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF\nwas different from the others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1273984"
msgid "…but that Servant is the worst.\nI went to talk to #C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF, and he tore me\nopen a new one with his criticisms!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274116"
msgid "Agh! It pisses me off so much!\nHe looks pretty similar to me on the outside,\nso who does he think he is!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274224"
msgid "Stolen memories?\nI guess if you say you'll give them to me,\nI'll take 'em off your hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274316"
msgid "But is it really alright? If you recall\nmemories of the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, you might\nend up bawling your eyes out, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274468"
msgid "After all, I've been kicking asses without\ntaking names, so I must've had you checkmated!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274560"
msgid "Nah, nah. It's all good. Even when we\nget our memories back, we're still pals.\nI'll treat you like I have been up until now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274688"
msgid "Yeah… I'm winning again and again…\nOf course I'll keep winning…\nI'm the top pick of this tournament…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274796"
msgid "But… #C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF are saying different\nthings… Imaginary number spaces, the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF…\n…why the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF won't intervene…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1274992"
msgid "…no, I better stop. If I think about it\ntoo seriously, I'll have nightmares…\nIt can't be… it can't…."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275100"
msgid "Listen here. I know plebs envy the talented.\nAnd I'm an adult, so I'll\nlet this be water under the bridge."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275208"
msgid "But come on! Is there no way everyone can\nSTOP FORGETTING about me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275280"
msgid "Even in the Student Council Room,\nmy name NEVER gets brought up!\nYou can't exclude people, it's not nice!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275388"
msgid "No need for me to even lift a finger.\nYou'll wipe the floor with that nasty AI\nfor us in no time, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275496"
msgid "W-was someone outta this world in the schoolyard\njust now!? They had a Spiritron structure\nbeyond a Servant's―the hell are they…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275632"
msgid "Since you have a Servant with you,\nyou're obligated to fight in my place.\nJust don't go dying in vain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275736"
msgid "Huh? You're gonna take #C236196003Jinako#CDEF to the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? That's a strategy even\nI wouldn't be able to manage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1275876"
msgid "If you're gonna take #C236196003Jinako#CDEF, then you'd have\na hell of an easier time taking one of\nthose trees in the schoolyard, instead!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276016"
msgid "Hmph. Wondering about what I'm doing here?\nI'm not exactly staring at the sunset\nand getting all down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276120"
msgid "This spot gets good reception. I can't take\nover the old school's system, it's being\nmanaged by the Student Council and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276264"
msgid "But, though slowly, I can gather Sakurament\nwhen I stand here! Geniuses don't need to even\nlift a finger, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276376"
msgid "Just you wait, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWith all the power source I'll stockpile,\nI'll whip up a special #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF#RUBS  technique#RUBE program#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276544"
msgid "You're not shrewd enough to know to run\nfrom a situation like that.\nYou must've had no choice… right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276648"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF, huh…\nShe's an oddball, but she's still a Game Champ.\nShe won't go down so easy…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276764"
msgid "…oh, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nWord is you're going to break open\nthat memory data you got."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276856"
msgid "…#C000246204let's go to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nYou're the only people I don't want getting\na one-up on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1276972"
msgid "Aww, damn… damn… damn…!\nI should've never gone through with it\nif THIS was going to happen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277068"
msgid "…didn't I tell you not to talk to me?\nCan you not remember squat, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277160"
msgid "Ha! You can't, can you!\nYou remembered everything BUT yourself!\nIt's plastered all over your face!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277260"
msgid "MAN. Same old, same old, huh!?\nYou're such a wimp that it pisses me off,\nso take a hike in the Labyrinth or something!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277380"
msgid "That explains why she had over 6,000 hours\nof playtime in FA. The Total Champ turned out\nto be a pretty lonely person…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277500"
msgid "Damn! Now I went and remembered it again!\nI was finally starting to calm down, too!\nDamn it, damn it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277604"
msgid "I'm not like him. I'm special.\nI'm going to get out of this alive,\nno matter what…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277692"
msgid "………what is it? Can't you see me\nthinking here? If you want some friends,\nhow about you try the Student Council Room?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277812"
msgid "Yo, if it isn't #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nGood job crawling back out of rock bottom.\nSo, what's the plan now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1277920"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF is gone and #C236196003Julius#CDEF is gone.\nWe have no chance of winning, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278024"
msgid "Well, if it comes to that,\nwe'll be living like chained slaves, though!\nHahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278104"
msgid "I knew the differences between\nplebs and geniuses, but THIS was REAL cruel.\nWoe to the unchosen guys."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278208"
msgid "#C236196003Ms. Kiara#CDEF is dead…?\nYou're joking… #C236196003BB#CDEF said as long as we don't\noppose her, she won't kill us…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278340"
msgid "Shit! So that's how it is!?\nIn the end, we're all going to… Damn it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278412"
msgid "I know. Not only was I useless,\nbut on top of betraying you,\nI proactively got in your way!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278504"
msgid "I'm the very definition of a silly clown!\nEnough, please stop treating me like an ally!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278592"
msgid "C'mon, please stay away from me!\nI'm the one turning down your pity!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278664"
msgid "Like I said yesterday,\ndon't go to the Labyrinth anymore.\nThat way none of us have to die……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278760"
msgid "I've done what I needed to do.\nI'll haul ass after I take a breather."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278832"
msgid "………………well.\nPlaying friends with each other\nwasn't so boring after all, huh…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1278920"
msgid "Oh, what's up, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nThat outfit sure takes me back.\nFelt like the preliminaries for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279032"
msgid "Eh? You found that in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF? \nYou can really find anything over there, \ncan't you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279148"
msgid "So you obtained new dust data.\nI'll begin decompressing it, then. A volume of\nthis size should take a few seconds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279264"
msgid "………………………decompression failed.\nAnd verification, complete.\nSo that's what it was, after all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279368"
msgid "The contents of the first cube was\na compressed version of the first Arena."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279444"
msgid "The contents of the second cube was\na compressed, special hostile program."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279520"
msgid "It appears to be a skill which\ncompresses anything to its minimum, no matter\nhow large the volume is, and stores it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279640"
msgid "The issue is in, I think, that this compression\nis irreversible. Whatever data she compresses\ncan never return to its original form."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279776"
msgid "The moment it gets compressed into a cube shape,\nthe data becomes garbage which merely\n\"was once that kind of data.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1279896"
msgid "Though it's compressed, it can't be\ndecompressed. Though it's destroyed,\nit persists as it was before in form――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280012"
msgid "…this data, thrown away in the #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF, is a mass of information which we\ncan't comprehend from our point of view."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280156"
msgid "Is a person a person because they're in the\nshape of a person? If you gather up human parts,\na human's necessary materials, is it human?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280296"
msgid "Where does one put the soul, all the qualia?\n…if we put those questions aside… This\ncompression may be an instance of eternity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280428"
msgid "Those who are compressed by #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF\nare anchored for eternity, and are stowed away\nin a storage named the \"recycle bin.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280568"
msgid "What lies ahead for them is Hell, where they\nlive on, transformed into slices of flesh. That\nsuffering isn't perceivable to us, outside."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1280708"
msgid "Mystic Code \"#C000246204Dustcloud of Osiris#CDEF\""
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line2
msgctxt "1280760"
msgid "added to the Commissary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280788"
msgid "Apologies for the wait.\nThe data #C236196003Archer#CDEF gave us has\nfinished decompressing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1280880"
msgid "Since the folder is unnamed, we don't know whose\nmemory this belongs to… But this is an advanced\narchive file utilizing pseudo-Spiritrons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281020"
msgid "If we open the folder, a patch will\nautomatically be applied on its owner.\nShall we open it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281116"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF was cautious about storing it, after all.\nThere's a high chance that there's a clue\nin it that will help us defeat her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281256"
msgid "P-please wait!\nYou can't go opening someone's \"memory\" when\nyou don't know who it belongs to――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281356"
msgid "There's nothing risky about it, right?\nIt's not as if someone else's memory is\ngoing to get overwritten."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281464"
msgid "Overwriting memories that aren't yours to\nbrainwash someone is a huge endeavor.\nEven #C236196003BB#CDEF would need some time to pull it off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281608"
msgid "Simply opening the file and having the memories\nreturn to their owner won't matter. If they're\nfake, they'll bounce off of the soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281744"
msgid "Then I'll extract it.\nI believe it'll be relevant to either\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, or me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281880"
msgid "Close your eyes, relax your consciousness.\nAlright―― I'm opening it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1281952"
msgid "I haven't discovered anything new, either.\nIt must have belonged to #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF then,\nI suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282072"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, please comment. If it's hard\nto speak aloud, or even if it's a memory of Miss\n#C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, feel free to write it down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282260"
msgid "I take issue with these two keenly peeping at me exclusively.\nAnyway, I don't feel very much different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282364"
msgid "…if I recall correctly, it was said during that\n#C000246204BB Channel#CDEF that the \"truth\" would be revealed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282476"
msgid "I see. Well, it'll become clear at some point,\nlike it or not. Don't worry about it,\njust keep exploring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282584"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF is right.\nLet's get to doing what we can do right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282660"
msgid "…hm? I may just be imagining it,\nbut #C236196003Sakura#CDEF seems to be acting a little strange.\nShe looks pale and seems to be suppressing some chills."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282816"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF…?\nYour thought-routines aren't stable.\nHas your accumulated #RUBS fatigue#RUBEdamage#REND not gone away?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1282948"
msgid "…what was that?\nAs #C236196003Sakura#CDEF went to leave the Student Council Room,\nshe glanced at me as if to tell me something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283080"
msgid "Maybe she wants to tell me something in private?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283132"
msgid "…what's the matter?\nI don't think there's any more\nneed to speak to me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283208"
msgid "…the old me wouldn't have suffered.\nIf I hadn't learned about the human mind,\nI would've maintained my own mental state――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283336"
msgid "…still need something?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1283360"
msgid "…no, it's nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283380"
msgid "…how about going to your room and\ngetting some sleep?\nYou look tired. We both do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283464"
msgid "Every #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF erases all NPCs\nand resets every AI's experiences."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283584"
msgid "…let's see.\nMy guess is that so it won't deviate from how\nit should be as an observation machine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283684"
msgid "In reality, it may be so that it avoids\ncases like the one we're in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283756"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is the eye of god. Within the\nCore is its storage medium, made of photons,\nwhich exists on a higher dimension."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1283900"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF knows how to end humanity.\nHowever, it provides no evaluation of such\na result."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284020"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF doesn't say which choices lead to\na better future―― That is to say, it has no\ncriteria for evaluating good and bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284168"
msgid "That's exactly why it leaves humanity to manage\nthe Earth. No, it exclusively acts as an\noutsider that never intervenes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284292"
msgid "But, if an AI with a clear criteria were to\nenter it, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF may use it as a part\nof its intelligence and pick a better future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284444"
msgid "――Which would be the obliteration of humanity.\nIf they're ultimately going to go extinct,\nthen it should be done now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284564"
msgid "Taking it as a decision that curbs the\nwaste of resources, I think it's\nextremely logical."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284656"
msgid "So long as it's an AI that can't break from being rational,\nany AI would choose to \"purge the Earth of humans.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284768"
msgid "In #C236196003BB#CDEF's case, her method―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284812"
msgid "\"Collapse by way of human free will\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1284852"
msgid "The result of all this is that what wasn't\nsupposed to be possible to happen did… Some\nfatal bug has occurred in the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285000"
msgid "It's not that Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, you, or I were\ninadequate. Nor is it #C236196003Sakura#CDEF or #C236196003BB#CDEF's fault.\nThat bug is the cause of this destruction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285180"
msgid "Saying this, #C236196003Rani#CDEF then stops talking.\n…it looks like #C236196003Rani#CDEF is more defeated than #C236196003Rin#CDEF is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285320"
msgid "It truly pains me to say this:\nit's impossible to analyze any further\nwith just Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and me alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285444"
msgid "Figures… So it's not going to be that easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285492"
msgid "\"#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF\" is a part of #C236196003BB#CDEF's matrix.\nIt's not likely that she would reveal her weaknesses so easily."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285628"
msgid "It's thanks to the #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF that we got part of that data.\nWe couldn't have done it on our own――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285748"
msgid "So please provide us with Sakurament.\nWith this many points,\nI'll get this analysis done in three minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285856"
msgid "So it WAS that easy…!\nIt's a massive amount of points,\nbut it's enough to scrape together somehow!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1285956"
msgid "Look me in the eye, Darling!\nAs the keeper of our finances, I can't approve\nof such wasteful spending!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286060"
msgid "So money speaks loudest in the end, as usual.\n\"King of Heroes Money-is-Power system\"… hmph.\nHas a nice ring to it, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286188"
msgid "Hey! You stole that from me!\nThe Money-is-Power system is a #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF business!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286284"
msgid "It is what it is.\nWe simply don't have enough mechanical power.\nWe have to make up for where we fall short."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286392"
msgid "Haven't I said this before?\nMoney. Money makes the world go round."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286460"
msgid "Have you gathered the Sakurament?\nThen please transfer it to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286528"
msgid "Wait, I don't have enough on hand.\nLet's come back once we earn #C00024620450,000 Sm#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286620"
msgid "Once you gather enough, please #C000246204come talk to me#CDEF.\nI'll get this analysis done in three minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286732"
msgid "Please give me a few minutes.\nI swear on Isis, mother of magic,\nthat I will unveil #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "1286844"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's #C000246204Matrix#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286888"
msgid "I don't see a way to block #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF,\nbut I have an idea on how to counteract it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1286988"
msgid "After analyzing #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF,\nI acquired privileges from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nto access \"primordial powers.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287120"
msgid "#C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF is the genesis of human history;\nthe dawn lighting over civilization."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287220"
msgid "To summarize, it's an #ROFS0001#RUBS    origin#RUBEarchetypal#REND power from\nwhich human genes began.\nIt is inherent within every human being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287364"
msgid "If they're equal in strength, then it\nmay prevent #C000246204Ten Crowns#CDEF ability to make things\n\"as if they never happened.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287496"
msgid "Hm? A Servant's primordial strength…\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF, you don't mean…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287576"
msgid "Primordial… One's origin, huh? The original\nform of a Heroic Spirit that even we have no\nknowledge of… No way. Really?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287700"
msgid "Gehh!\n\"Primordial\" is referring to my\nsource material!? Oh boy, so that means…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287780"
msgid "Oh?\nSo you mean to involve my prototype?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287824"
msgid "Yes. Diving into a Servant's Cyber Frame and\ndirectly accessing their Heroic Spirit core will\nreveal their root, sealed by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1287980"
msgid "We'll unlock a \"#C000246204Mythological Mystic Code#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288040"
msgid "Going directly into a Heroic Spirit's core…\nLike when we did a mental dive into #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288148"
msgid "#[He][She]#'s going inside me!?\nJ-j-just one thing―who will protect\nPraetor if #[he][she]#'s inside me!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288256"
msgid "Not to brag or anything,\nbut my red blood cells… rather, my sanitation\nprogram is vicious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288348"
msgid "If you throw my adorable Praetor in there,\nI'm certain #[he][she]# won't last two seconds!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288440"
msgid "Diving into a Servant's digital frame…\nIt may be possible, but it comes with risk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288524"
msgid "So it really has come to this, huh?\nDarling is going to see this part and that part\nof my insides, goodness――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288636"
msgid "Hyaan, how embarrassing for #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288688"
msgid "Ha!? W-well, let's leave that aside for now!\nAs much as I LOVE my Darling, my sanitation\nprogram on the other hand…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288808"
msgid "I don't have control as far down as the cells\nguarding my body. They won't recognize you as\nDarling; they'll try to harm an intruder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1288944"
msgid "Now this is extraordinary. I won't deny you\nto experience my prototype… but with it\ncomes equal part risk, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289064"
msgid "Any body will have a sanitation system serving\nas the immune function. There are neither\nenemies nor allies there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289180"
msgid "…that's the one issue. While we can use #C000246204Multi-\nColored Tranquility#CDEF to send in #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF,\n#[his][her]# Servant won't be there for protection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289352"
msgid "I planned to include an escort doll to serve\nas a pseudo-Servant, but the doll doesn't\nhave very high stats…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289464"
msgid "…realistically, we can't. #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is already\nutilizing memory beyond her limits to maintain\nthe old school building's systems."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289608"
msgid "Performing analyses is one thing, but we don't\nhave the spare memory to add a new,\nindependent function."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289716"
msgid "O-okay, that would do――\nW-wait, that won't change the fact that\nPraetor will be seeing my insides!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289820"
msgid "More importantly, under no circumstance\ncan I allow Praetor to contract with\nanyone but me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1289912"
msgid "…makes sense.\n#C236196003Karna#CDEF is a Servant deserving of full confidence.\nI need to prioritize my Master's safety."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290036"
msgid "…though, personally, I find it hard to\nagree to this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290092"
msgid "T-this is a lot to take in… My instincts are\ntelling me to protect Darling, but I'm also\nthinking that I'm getting what I deserve."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290224"
msgid "I honestly don't like #[him][her]# contracting another\nServant, but #C236196003Karna#CDEF won't bother becoming a\nrival, I think, so I'll allow it this once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290384"
msgid "So, him… He certainly is competent.\nI have no objections to his\ndignity and strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290472"
msgid "But do not contract him, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nA trial contract should pose no issue, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290572"
msgid "What other choice do we have?\nYou'll have to work with it. We absolutely need\na buffed Servant to compete with #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290704"
msgid "Same goes for you, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nThis will be your second dive, so please\nprepare for it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290804"
msgid "I know diving into a digital frame is dangerous,\nbut this is our last hope."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290880"
msgid "…yeah. Worst case, we can force her… but I\nwouldn't even bet on #C236196003#NICK#CDEF's\nlife that we could do it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1290996"
msgid "So… There is one thing we can try…\nShe'll definitely get on board if\nwe sell it well…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291088"
msgid "She doesn't seem to be referring to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291152"
msgid "Don't mind me, just thinking out loud.\nPlease go #C000246204convince Jinako#CDEF. She won't talk\nto anyone but you at this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291284"
msgid "I'm not very confident that I can succeed\nin persuading her, but without #C236196003Karna#CDEF's help,\nit's too dangerous to dive into my Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291432"
msgid "For now, let's go to the #C000246204Janitor's Closet#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291492"
msgid "Now that #C236196003Rani#CDEF mentions it, I forgot about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291556"
msgid "In that case, I recommend gathering some\ninformation at the library."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291628"
msgid "He's one of many famous heroes of India's\nmythology… There should be detailed\ndescriptions of him in the #C000246204sacred Mahabarata#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291772"
msgid "Makes sense.\nKnowing that makes this a lot easier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291824"
msgid "Before going into the Relief,\nlet's stop by the #C000246204library#CDEF and investigate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1291916"
msgid "It's good that you're safe, #[Mr.][Ms.]# #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nI heard about what happened from Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292044"
msgid "#C236196003President Leo#CDEF's final moments, #C236196003BB#CDEF's goal…\nThe problems are piling up.\nWe mustn't lose heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292172"
msgid "We'll gather the resources we have left,\nand with #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's aid, the Student Council\nwill unite to take measures against #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292328"
msgid "#C236196003President #GIVEN#CDEF… I was wavering over\nwhether to report this to you or not, but I'll\njust go ahead and tell you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292460"
msgid "About the #C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF we discussed\npreviously: it's not something we programmed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292564"
msgid "It's a gift #C236196003BB#CDEF gave us and put in the\nStudent Council Room. I suppose it's her\nway of provoking us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292680"
msgid "Before these \"seven days\" come to pass,\nlet's do whatever it takes to prevent #C236196003BB#CDEF from\nreaching the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292832"
msgid "Good day. This is the first time we've spoken\n#RUBS        this side#RUBEon the #REND#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292956"
msgid "…the first time, RIGHT?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1292984"
msgid "My analysis of the dust data continues.\nThis data requires a massive amount of storage,\nso it seems its use will be limited."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293112"
msgid "However… I know this is immodest,\nbut the decompression of this strange\n#RUBS              codec  #RUBEcompression information#REND makes my heart throb."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293268"
msgid "Although her abilities are unknown to us,\nwe can expect that she has considerable\nfirepower. Please be extra careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293388"
msgid "Good morning.\nIn this old school, it's evening\nall day long, I see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293456"
msgid "The damage done to the data wasn't my fault.\nI'm careful never to make mistakes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293540"
msgid "I don't want to think about it, but it must\nhave something to do with a skill she possesses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293636"
msgid "I'm estimating it will be a 225% increase\nin security. It won't break even if an elephant\ncame crashing on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293748"
msgid "The most effective way to protect an #C000246204SG#CDEF\nis for the Sentinel to conceal themselves\nand never appear before you, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293912"
msgid "Does she have unshakable confidence\nthat her #C000246204SG#CDEF can't be stolen…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1293996"
msgid "…it's inexplicable. All I can think of is\nthat there's#RUBS     a bug#RUBE an issue#REND with\n#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's #RUBS subroutines#RUBEprinciples#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294160"
msgid "I completed a program that increases resistance\nto Instant Death. I already provided the\nCommissary with the necessary information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294292"
msgid "I also supplied it to the Commissary\nin order to simplify their process of\ngathering and mass productionizing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294404"
msgid "Please don't get me wrong. I don't think like\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF does. She would do something like \ncollude with Mr. #C236196003Kotomine#CDEF for profit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294568"
msgid "Great reviews at the Commissary, and there's a\nspecial going on―― No service fee!\nPlease be sure to purchase one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294684"
msgid "So, a pretend couple………………………\n…………………………………………\n………………………………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294788"
msgid "………no, I don't really think anything\nof it. I expect this to turn out well.\nPlease go to hel… erm, do your best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1294908"
msgid "Even if I recover my memories, no part of me\nwill fall out of order… but what about\neveryone else?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295008"
msgid "Now I know for sure. That my actions\nduring my time as a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF were\na temporary confusion, not my true self."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295136"
msgid "That's because the subconscious doesn't surface.\nAlso, when one is a Labyrinth,\nthey're synchronized with #C236196003BB#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295264"
msgid "An unwanted personality change happens,\nbasically. Yep, I think that's it.\nOtherwise these #C000246204SGs#CDEF couldn't possibly exist!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295400"
msgid "Ahhh. I must say, those were\nsome impressively dramatic changes\nthe two of you went through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295496"
msgid "Hohoho. Is #C236196003President Leo#CDEF running his mouth?\nPerhaps I should start setting off\nsome Atlas-style mustard bombs around here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295636"
msgid "I agree with #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's suggestion for\na tea party. For humans to have a burst in\nperformance, they must be mentally satiated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295784"
msgid "A group whose leader demands 100% performance\nat all times has no future. Look no further\nthan history for proof of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1295908"
msgid "What I'm saying is, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF is a leader\naccustomed to that performance, although I don't\nknow if that's from intent or from instinct."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296064"
msgid "And so with that, I'll be polishing my tea-\nmaking skills in preparation for the coming day\nof our tea party. Please look forward to it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296204"
msgid "To be able to maintain one's ego without\nbeing influenced by instinctive desires and\nlaziness is a privilege of rational people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296336"
msgid "I just can't comprehend this statement\nfrom #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296412"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF… She's a person that I\ncan't understand, but I CAN understand\nher righteousness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296528"
msgid "She helps people without reward, without\nimposing her ideas. The ethics and social\nwelfare behind her ideology are wonderful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296656"
msgid "The truth is that many sick people and people\nat a low point in their lives are grateful\nto her. Truly a modern-day saint."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296780"
msgid "It's sad, but organizations out for profit\ntargeted her for that reason and labeled her\nas a cybercriminal――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1296892"
msgid "Ah!? So that's it. Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF dislikes her\nbecause it's a clash of the avaricious character\nversus the non-avaricious character…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297044"
msgid "I don't think any direct harm will come to us,\nbut bear in mind that #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF\ndoesn't have a normal mindset."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297176"
msgid "Everyone puts themselves first.\nHowever, I believe that you're quite not\nso inclined to do so, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297296"
msgid "A bystander might praise that as hard\nto come by, but depending on the situation,\nit could be fatal. Please be careful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297416"
msgid "To be more specific, #C236196003President Leo#CDEF's style was\nin desk work. Your style is in field work,\n#C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297560"
msgid "This may sound cruel, but you won't be allowed\nto rest, #C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF. Please be ready\nfor more back-breaking work than ever before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297716"
msgid "You'll be fine. There's never been a single\nincident of a human being dying over food\ntasting bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297816"
msgid "The unarmed Shinji-boy――\nConsidering it was free software, it did a #RUBS  good job#RUBEGJ#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1297916"
msgid "I gave it four stars on the store. I wasn't a\nfan of the avatar's design, so that was a minus.\nI'm looking forward to the next version."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298052"
msgid "Between my intervention with Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF and\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's self-protect program, we're suppressing\nthe encroachment for the time being――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298220"
msgid "We don't know when she'll be breached.\nHurry, get the #C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298320"
msgid "――――I don't understand what that means.\nHowever, we're racing against time.\nPlease #C000246204get a hold of Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298456"
msgid "Have you gotten the #C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF?\nThen #C000246204speak to Miss Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298564"
msgid "Please leave the rest to us\nand get some rest, President."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298624"
msgid "Even if we flex our technical muscles and apply\npatches to strengthen her, what will ultimately\nsave her is someone's #ROFS0003#RUBSheart#RUBEmind#REND――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298780"
msgid "It's not logical, but with how I am now,\nI feel elated that such is the case.\nPlease take care of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1298928"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF… One more #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF.\nIt wouldn't be wrong to consider her as #C236196003BB#CDEF's\nlast bastion of defense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299080"
msgid "However… She turned #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF into a virus,\ncast her out, and worse. #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's threat\nlevel is different than the other #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299264"
msgid "Once I gain more emotions, I think I'll send\nMiss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF a thank-you letter. Naturally, I'll\nthank her for teaching me what not to do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299416"
msgid "And I deem that it's thanks to Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nthat I got this good at making jokes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299516"
msgid "I'm confident in how I shaped the decoys to\nuse against #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF. It's at a level where\nI could ship them out as official figurines."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299668"
msgid "…I wasn't expecting those memories to not\nbelong to anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299732"
msgid "In that case, where did that memory data\nend up going, I wonder?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299800"
msgid "She didn't modify herself, but rather,\nthe system. Quite a hacker's way of thinking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1299888"
msgid "Without Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF here, a hacker on\nthe international most wanted list,\nwe likely wouldn't have realized it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300016"
msgid "We'll continue our analysis on how\nto overcome #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's #C000246204Invincibility#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300124"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF's Relief…\nShe also possesses a weakness in her heart,\nsome trauma…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300220"
msgid "…no, this is not a good choice of\nperson to sympathize with."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300284"
msgid "We've made it this far at great cost.\n#C236196003President #GIVEN#CDEF,\nplease prepare for the battle ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300396"
msgid "Our support is perfect now that we have more\nmechanical power, but convincing Miss #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF\nis a different story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300528"
msgid "This is something that only you can pull off,\n#C236196003President #FAMILY#CDEF. We're counting on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300632"
msgid "You want to know what familiar Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nprepared for you? Sorry, she didn't tell me\nanything about it, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300764"
msgid "However, you should know better than anyone\nthat whatever Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF prepares always goes\nabove our expectations, #C236196003President #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1300932"
msgid "…well, more like diagonally above our\nexpectations, but that's what's\ncharming about her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301024"
msgid "…ah, yes. It's been some time since I\nread the stars. Perhaps I'll do so.\nMay a good light shine over our battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301140"
msgid "Well, well.\nYou're wearing our uniform\nfrom the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301212"
msgid "…but man…\nIt's a good thing I walked in normally…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301268"
msgid "If I had just a little more courage, I ALMOST\nwould've decided to drop in with a pose\nlike a mighty morphing hero…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301384"
msgid "I eavesdropped on your chat with #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nThis is all way beyond me, ya.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's gonna be at the Janitor's Closet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301528"
msgid "…no matter how much you pep me up,\nin the end, a snail is a snail, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nI can't change my personality that easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301660"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF has graduated from NEET-hood.\nFrom now on, I'll be intangible like a ghost."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301760"
msgid "…so, I don't want you to worry over me.\nPlease treat me like I'm not even here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301844"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is sound asleep.\nShe doesn't plan on waking up anytime soon,\nand any plans after that are TBD!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1301964"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF seems to be sleeping with her eyes open.\nPerhaps this is another part of her training.\nI'm sorry, but leave her for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302120"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's not the type you wanna get close to, huh?\nBut she's got this enticing smell of sweets\nabout her～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302240"
msgid "An emotionless glasses girl, AND flat to boot?\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF got some fearsome attributes there.\nMight even be a bit too much, honestly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302384"
msgid "If there's no thread on this in 2 minutes, \nI'll make her mai waifu!\nGah! That's what I'mma do～♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302484"
msgid "…hm?\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF, aren't you supposed to specify\na value of temperature when you say \"tepid\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302592"
msgid "…*sigh*. I don't need tasteless quips for\nevery little remark. And like, your quip is\nalready tasteless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302700"
msgid "…I see. Sorry about that.\nWell then, I'd like you to tell me what it was\nthat hurt your feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302800"
msgid "Was it that I interrupted your meal?\nYou DO always look happy when you're stuffing\nyour mouth with snacks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302908"
msgid "Even if someone were to think you looked\nlike a sea lion or a seal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1302976"
msgid "Agh, enough! That's what I'm talking about!\nJeez, why did I have to draw a Servant like\nthis?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303072"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is currently guarding her home～\nI'm super busy finding myself,\nso dash outta here―― and make it double!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303204"
msgid "Sorry. #C236196003Jinako#CDEF can't handle all this free time,\nas you can see. Don't pay any heed.\nCome back again sometime."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303332"
msgid "Don't go blabbing about what they don't need\nto know! If you underestimate guarding your\nown home, you'll regret it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303452"
msgid "Enough, there's no way. I can't move an inch.\nNEETs ain't made for working.\nIf we work, we lose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303552"
msgid "Oh, wow～ We've got a top tier enemy here!\nBy \"top,\" I mostly mean her chesties, ofc. Them\ntig bitties got plenty mass for sandwichin'."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303688"
msgid "So you're pretty popular right now.\nWhat's so great about being a normie?\nMakes no sense to this shut-in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303796"
msgid "Are you saying I'm as thin as a bean sprout?\nI see, it's pertinent. This is the first I've\nheard of thin builds being unpopular, though."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1303936"
msgid "If so, then you have the makings of\none who's plenty popular, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF.\nSince you're the opposite of thin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304060"
msgid "You're implying I'm FAT, yo! If you're supposed\nto be a Servant, then be a little more sensitive\nto how your Master feels!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304184"
msgid "That's not my point!\nAgh, someone please rewire the speech center\nin this guy's brain…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304272"
msgid "You sure like to walk around aimlessly. How\nabout you don't come here, and instead go to the\nLabyrinth to meet with her, fair prince?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304408"
msgid "Hm? Whassup?\nYou don't need me for anything anymore, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304468"
msgid "………or something like that.\nBluffing is real tough on me, so the nice\nthing to do is leave me alone, see?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304576"
msgid "Still goin' around, exposing girls'#RUBS   traumas#RUBE secrets#REND\nin the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, huh?\nWell aren't you energetic～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304720"
msgid "But #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's already closed shop.\nAll I'm gonna do now is mumble curses at you,\nso you may want to leave."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304844"
msgid "This normie is gonna do her normie thing――\nJust look over news sites while letting the\ndiscontent leak outta me～"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1304960"
msgid "So, how about buzzing off to the Labyrinth?\nYou may be normal, but unlike me,\nyou're a proper, pro Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305068"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's new job is \"ghost.\" Talking to me\nis pointless; lecturing, pointless; attacking,\npointless; diet, pointless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305204"
msgid "A true background character with no collision\ndetection. Seriously, how many times do I gotta'\nsay it before you get it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305328"
msgid "No, I really can't do it…\nNo matter how hard a snail tries,\nit's still a snail…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305412"
msgid "Yep. And with that, we part.\nNo more event flags are gonna get set!\nI know you love glasses, just give up鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305520"
msgid "You still intend on trying something? I think\nyou're incredible #C236196003#NICK#CDEF #[my boy][babe]#,\nbut sometimes it's pointless to push on…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305668"
msgid "I told you before.\nI have no intention of helping you.\nComing here is a waste of time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305756"
msgid "Sorry, I don't know why #C236196003Karna#CDEF is being so\nstubborn, either. I think it's\nprobably… pointless to talk to him about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1305892"
msgid "I'll be streaming your heroism #C236196003#NICK#CDEF-#[boy～][pal～]#\nHellfire shall rain down on the comment section!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306012"
msgid "So… yeah, go get 'em. I know it's a bit\nlate to say this, but for you I guess,\nI can give my full support."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306120"
msgid "You're #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF, huh?\nMoving around even though you just woke up――\nYou've got quite the vitality."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306244"
msgid "Apart from the Masters like yourself,\nregular NPCs and management NPCs are taking\nrefuge in this old school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306364"
msgid "In the Near Side of the Moon… in the #C000246204Holy Grail\nWar#CDEF, there were tons of you Masters.\nHere, we outnumber you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306492"
msgid "This old school building is safe for now.\nNot even the Black Noise invades here.\nFeel free to take a walk around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306608"
msgid "The Arena… You mean the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nWhen you're in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF and want to\nuse items, press the #C000246204□ button#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306780"
msgid "You should have a map of the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF.\nIf you're ever thinking, \"man, this is so\nsmaalll,\" then press the #C000246204SELECT button#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1306944"
msgid "Then you'll be able to see a bigger map.\nBe careful though, it won't show you places you\nhaven't been to before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307060"
msgid "When you want to return from the #C000246204Sakura\nLabyrinth#CDEF, you can either leave\nvia the entrance or a checkpoint."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307184"
msgid "Dying is no joke. When you think things are\ngetting too hot, come back to the old school\nright away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307288"
msgid "And, all that #C000246204SG#CDEF and #RUBSSentinel#RUBEGuardian#REND stuff? Might be\na good idea to throw out whatever we considered\ncommon sense up until now…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307452"
msgid "It looks like there are two kinds of boxes\nin the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307536"
msgid "Blue ones have normal items.\nRed ones have rare items.\nGenerally speaking, that's how it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307632"
msgid "I told you before about how pressing the select\nbutton will bring up a full-screen map of the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307768"
msgid "To tell you the truth, I hear that there are\npaths that don't show up on the map of\nthe #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307892"
msgid "It might be a good idea to carefully\nwalk around suspicious places."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1307960"
msgid "Just knowing that won't help avoid them,\nbut hey, knowing beforehand won't hurt. Make\nsure you're well prepared before you go in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308092"
msgid "It's finally over!\nWe're going back to the Near Side!\n…is what I was hoping to say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308180"
msgid "I can't believe she can create offshoots\nand even turn them into Labyrinths……\nJust how much uptime does #C236196003BB#CDEF have…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308316"
msgid "Although it takes the Master's MP to use\nMystic Codes, and the Servant's MP to use\nbattle skills, MP is critical."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308432"
msgid "If you don't spend MP wisely, you won't be able\nto use anything when you really need it.\nWatch it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308532"
msgid "Did you know? When inside the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF,\nyou can move your POV around with the #C000246204L button#CDEF\nand the #C000246204R button#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308696"
msgid "If you haven't done it already, try looking\naround that way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308760"
msgid "In the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, if you press the\n#C000246204L button#CDEF and #C000246204R button#CDEF simultaneously, your POV\nwill snap back to where you're facing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1308936"
msgid "Well, what happened to #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF\ndoes suck, but don't let it get to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309032"
msgid "You guys will make everything right again.\nI'm counting on you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309096"
msgid "Listen. This advice I'm about to let you in\non is more important than all the rest.\nDon't forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309200"
msgid "'cause you won't know how much damage you're\ngonna take in the next fight.\n\"A stitch in time saves nine,\" basically."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309320"
msgid "The hostile programs drifting around in the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF attack when you enter\ntheir range."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309432"
msgid "If you attack with a \"shockwave\" skill before\nmaking contact, you'll start the battle\nwith an advantage."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309540"
msgid "That damn #C236196003BB#CDEF… She's a disgrace to all AIs…\nWho is she to up and ignore our full surrender?\nCan't she do a cost-benefit analysis?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309688"
msgid "You really are the only one we can rely on,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF… Please delete that\nmad AI with your own two hands…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309820"
msgid "A Noble Phantasm represents the truth about a\nHeroic Spirit. To use it, one must know who the\nHeroic Spirit really is―― Their True Name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1309960"
msgid "To put it in an archaic-sounding way,\nit's \"unveiling the True Name.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310032"
msgid "A Noble Phantasm certainly is powerful, but it's\nnot something you should treat casually. It's\nthe same as a Servant's pride."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310160"
msgid "These floors just keep getting bigger.\nSometimes the fastest way is to go one step at\na time; not rushing, just keeping steady."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310288"
msgid "Don't forget, \"slow and steady wins the race.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310336"
msgid "Even if we could go somewhere other than the\n#C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF, it would essentially be the\nsame thing. I'm sure you can handle it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310484"
msgid "Thank you for saving #C236196003Sakura Matou#CDEF.\n…umm, you know. She may be higher ranking,\nbut she's still an AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310604"
msgid "Among the administrators, some consider her\ndangerous since she's the same model as #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310708"
msgid "…they figure if #C236196003BB#CDEF went rogue,\nthere's a risk she could go rogue as well,\nbeing the same model and all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310832"
msgid "And the reality is that she's going against the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's rules by helping you Masters.\nBut in that case, the same goes for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1310980"
msgid "Only you guys can deal with this situation. You\nmay be disgusted with the administrator's sorry\nstate, but please don't abandon them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311116"
msgid "Enemy attacks are really starting to hurt now,\nso there'll probably be times when you don't\nwant to take damage at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311236"
msgid "When you can't see their move,\nwhat you can do is use an #C000246204offensive Skill#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311328"
msgid "When you use an attack skill, the enemy can't\nuse Attack, Guard, or Break on that move.\nThis is good to keep in mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311448"
msgid "When you use a skill that strengthens yourself,\nyou leave yourself open to your opponent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311540"
msgid "If you're going to use it, use it when your\nopponent is guarding themselves or when you\nhave plenty of health left."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311656"
msgid "I'm sure you've realized it at this point,\nbut the more of the same enemy you fight,\nthe more of their moves you'll see."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311780"
msgid "Your greatest weapon is the experience in\nbattle that you accumulate.\nRoutine work isn't pointless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311880"
msgid "You plan on going into the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1311944"
msgid "Hey, hey, don't do that. Aren't you being naive,\nthinking you can go in there without\nany backup? Even for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312056"
msgid "Apparently, there's a #C000246204twentieth floor of the\nSakura Labyrinth#CDEF. Which means the nineteenth――\nleads to the Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312188"
msgid "I have nothing left to teach you!\nGo forth, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF!\nYou're the final Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312292"
msgid "I have some information,\nthough it's not confirmed…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312348"
msgid "Apparently, some weird distortion appeared\n#C000246204at the end of the twentieth floor#CDEF.\nMay be worth checking out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312472"
msgid "…you want to know what I've been up to?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312516"
msgid "Cleaning gutters, as usual. While you had\n#C236196003BB#CDEF and #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF distracted, I took\nthe opportunity to examine the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312672"
msgid "But this time, it was all in vain.\nRather than find our #C000246204Memories#CDEF,\nI found #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF, who zeroed in on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312812"
msgid "Does that mean #C236196003Julius#CDEF was caught\nin the middle of his secret operation?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1312900"
msgid "Yeah, it was my biggest screw up ever… well,\nnot really. That woman has keen senses. She saw\nthrough my ordinary stealth, easy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313032"
msgid "She also caught on that I was searching for our\n#C000246204Memories#CDEF. I got away before her claws crushed\nme, but she'll notice if I go in there again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313188"
msgid "This is why #C236196003Leo#CDEF postponed my search to\nrecover our #C000246204Memories#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313284"
msgid "……………sorry about this.\nI tacked another job onto your workload."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313356"
msgid "I felt like I just saw something incredible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313404"
msgid "I don't know what exactly is incredible,\nbut I know it's something RARE."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313480"
msgid "I must not know because my #C000246204memory#CDEF is hazy.\nIf I get my #C000246204Memories#CDEF back, I should come\nto realize what this \"unthinkable thing\" is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313644"
msgid "So you need some money to pay #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF……?\nSorry. Try someone else.\nI don't think I can arrange for anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313776"
msgid "Money? Why are you asking me?\nI thought I already told you\nI can't arrange for anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313868"
msgid "If you want to borrow, then try someone else.\n……besides a #C236196003Harwey#CDEF, if possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1313968"
msgid "…………persistent, aren't you?\nStop bugging me. Try someone else. Got it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314044"
msgid "………………………………I have, no money."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1314088"
msgid "If you won't respond, shall I mess with you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314136"
msgid "Fine, you win. Put your hand out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314172"
msgid "I figured since he's #C236196003Leo#CDEF's older brother,\nhe would give me something a bit more generous……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314284"
msgid "I may be a #C236196003Harwey#CDEF, but outside of missions\nI didn't ever have money to throw around.\n……or ever needed to, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314416"
msgid "What I just handed over to you is absolutely\neverything I can call my own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314492"
msgid "That―― makes this 800 Sm really heavy.\nI can't just take everything he owns,\nso I'll give this back to #C236196003Julius#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314624"
msgid "You don't need to worry about it.\nFind any way you can to make good use of it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314704"
msgid "He decisively shot down the return,\nso I reluctantly pull my hand back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314776"
msgid "It's only right to give my thanks with a bow and \"Thank you.\"\nI'll return #C236196003Julius#CDEF' goodwill by getting #C236196003Rin#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF for sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314948"
msgid "…yeah. I'm counting on you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1314980"
msgid "……that was everything I owned.\nGet the most out of it that you can, for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315060"
msgid "About 20% of the participants freed\nthemselves from the #RUBS  roles#RUBEscript#REND the system prepared\nfor them. However…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315188"
msgid "Hm…? What's the matter?\nDon't take too many scenic routes.\nHurry up and go home."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315272"
msgid "Don't take too many scenic routes.\nHurry up and go home."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315332"
msgid "You may think #C236196003Leo#CDEF is an imposter,\nbut that there, without a doubt, is\nthe real thing. Just trust me on this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315460"
msgid "This is so we can return to the\nrightful #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF. The other Masters\nmust also lend their strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315584"
msgid "Our labor shortage hasn't been resolved.\nIt's obviously true that the burden lies on you.\nAccept it, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315712"
msgid "…so, you're back. As you heard from\nthe Student Council, return to the\n#C000246204second floor's My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315836"
msgid "The school is currently under maintenance.\nIt IS an old model after all. We can't let\nit end up like the Near Side school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1315960"
msgid "An amnesiac Master and a Servant who\ncan't unleash their full power. A shield in the\nLabyrinth. Things aren't looking so good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316088"
msgid "Still, a technique that deduces secrets\nof the mind and reveals them, huh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316164"
msgid "If it gets rid of the wall guarding a person's\nmind, then that means trespassing on another\nperson's Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316272"
msgid "#C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF called it a medicine.\nI think this sort of thing shouldn't be called\na vaccine; it should be called a virus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316408"
msgid "Your report can wait until after you rest.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF left a message: #C000246204head back\nto My Room and turn in for the day#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316552"
msgid "If you can spew that sort of nonsense, you're\nalready used to this strange state of affairs.\nThis much is more than enough for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316684"
msgid "I suggest you use that excess energy of yours\nto go back to your room and rest already.\n………………I'll put it under consideration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316820"
msgid "Did #C236196003Jinako#CDEF seem like she could be useful?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316880"
msgid "……well, it figures. She refuses to\neven show up to the Student Council Room.\nCan't expect miracles to happen now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1316996"
msgid "#[Yo][Hey]#…………………………………………\n…………………………… good, to, see, you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317084"
msgid "…………I'm not cut out for this.\nIt's much too hard to do things you're\nnot used to, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317184"
msgid "The greeting is cancelled. I'll go back to\nsimply verifying your return, just as before.\nThat should put you at ease as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317312"
msgid "We're skipping this morning's briefing.\nYou already know what you have to do.\n#C000246204Head to the Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317436"
msgid "…so even #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF can get desperate.\nSelling the rights to walk her own Labyrinth?\nA performance to put vultures to shame."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317580"
msgid "That makes #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's third #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nWe'll break that Relief with our next attack."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317696"
msgid "Everything's been going well so far, but\nthat woman's abilities as a Master are real.\nDon't let your guard down, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317836"
msgid "…she's revealed herself. It must've been\nwithin #C236196003Leo#CDEF's expectations that a mastermind\nwould be standing behind #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1317992"
msgid "But who could've guessed that it would\nbe a runaway AI, removed from being under\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's rules."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318112"
msgid "This is completely different from dealing with\nMasters as we have been.\nFirst thing to do is collect intel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318220"
msgid "You're back. …how was it?\nAfter getting corrected, are you more of an\nhonor student now?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318312"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's policies aside, a stance of upholding\nthe rules is a good thing.\nNothing to do with the military. You know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318444"
msgid "Now, quickly get back to your room and rest.\nNo unnecessary pit stops. Those are the words of\nmy old teachers. Heed them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318568"
msgid "I had left to investigate a previous floor\nof the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF that you conquered."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318672"
msgid "It was a very risky job. I did it despite\nknowing that it would be especially unfruitful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318764"
msgid "Though it did on a number on me. Having no\nServant, I'm used to this sort of dirty work.\nNothing for you to be concerned about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1318892"
msgid "Ah, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Looks like your mission\nwent without a hitch. Right now, I'm about\nto head back to the Labyrinth――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319024"
msgid "Wait. Why are you scowling at me? You don't\nwant me to resign from babysitting #C236196003Leo#CDEF?\n――――I see. I see……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319152"
msgid "…I won't bother asking what happened,\nbut I'll guess what's on your mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319228"
msgid "This may sound a bit out there, but…\nYour emotions and mine are unprecedentedly\nsynchronized."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319324"
msgid "So you made it back, too. You beat her pretty\ndamn fast… Ahh, your Servant isn't feeling so\nwell, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319428"
msgid "Good that you made it back.\nYou've taken some… no damage, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319492"
msgid "The Student Council is convened due to the\nspecial circumstances. You, too. Head to the\n#C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF right away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319632"
msgid "After you've freed #C236196003Rani#CDEF, don't pause.\nContinue to the end and capture #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319740"
msgid "Contrary to her looks, #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF specializes\nin operating covertly and in\nscouting out enemies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319856"
msgid "She can tail someone well at mid-range, but at\nclose range, you can hear her approaching\nby the sound of those claws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1319976"
msgid "…that #C236196003BB#CDEF has some bad taste.\nWho would make such a paradox out of\ntheir own offshoot?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320080"
msgid "Made it back, huh? How did you feel about\nfacing an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF? Was it a miserable\nmonster, like #C236196003BB#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320212"
msgid "…hm. No, it's none of my concern.\nNow's the time for rest, not chitchat, right?\nGo on inside. I'm calling it a day, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320336"
msgid "I… I had to drop what I was doing and race\nback from the Labyr… *cough*… much to\nmy chagrin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320432"
msgid "Regardless, I had to come back due to the\ncircumstances… don't mind me, rest up.\nWe'll be putting you to work again tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320560"
msgid "*cough cough*………\nI ran out of Return Crystals. I took off once\nI got word that you obtained an #C000246204SG#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320680"
msgid "Adding #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's power to our own\nwill open up new strategies, but we've already\nfailed once to persuade #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320836"
msgid "But the time is nigh. She can't look away\nforever. It's time to light a fire under\nthat woman's blubber of an ass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1320952"
msgid "Use your stubbor― ahem.\nUse your perseverant persuasion\nto open that shut-in's locks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321040"
msgid "…so, let's see if you pull this off.\n#C236196003Carigiri#CDEF's Servant definitely is a powerful\nHeroic Spirit. However――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321168"
msgid "Well, no use worrying about that now. The plan\nitself is sound. The rest is up to circumstance\nand how mentally prepared you two are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321304"
msgid "It's a little late to be saying this now, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321352"
msgid "Regardless of our Near Side relationship,\nuntil we escape the Far Side, we're still\ngoing to be in a partnership."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321468"
msgid "Let's both trust each other as much as possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321520"
msgid "I don't really need to be repeating this, but be\nsure to get some rest. If your body starts to\nfail, it'll mean disaster in whatever you do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321664"
msgid "Don't worry. Until we escape the Far Side,\nI don't intend on bringing up anything\nabout the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321788"
msgid "Currently, it looks like this job will keep me\nbusy… Oh please, after I wrap things up, I'll\nbe back again to do this dull check up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1321924"
msgid "I was the one who asked for the\njob of greeting you, after all, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nPhew. …see ya."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322028"
msgid "Wait, Praetor.\nThey went to the trouble of preparing My Room\nfor us. How about we call it a day?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322128"
msgid "Wait. Let's put off our exploration for\nnow and go see My Room. I need to talk to\nyou about something, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322240"
msgid "Where are you off to?\nThey've prepared a room for us, did they not?\nLet's go see what sort of room it is, first."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322356"
msgid "More importantly, the outfit!\nLet's hurry over to #C000246204where Rin is#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322436"
msgid "Phew. I can finally say bye to this outfit.\nLet's head to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF, Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322544"
msgid "Woohoo☆ A new outfit, a new outfit!\nLet's hurry and #C000246204go pick it up#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322628"
msgid "Did you not hear the transmission just now?\nYou should go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322732"
msgid "I'll head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest up.\nMaybe my voice will come back to me by then."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322832"
msgid "I have to go to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF\nand confirm what's going on…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1322920"
msgid "We need to deliver the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF to #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nI can't let his effort go to waste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323052"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323132"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323236"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323324"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323444"
msgid "It looks like you've done a lot of exploring.\nIsn't it about time to get to know your\nServant a little better?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323556"
msgid "You may find a chance to learn your Servant's SG\nby hanging out with them in the school building.\nHow about you go #C000246204look around the building#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323716"
msgid "…that's the suggestion I got, out of nowhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323764"
msgid "Now that he mentions it, I think #C236196003Saber#CDEF\ndid tell me she wanted something…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323856"
msgid "Before I go into the Labyrinth,\nmaybe I should go #C000246204look around the school building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1323956"
msgid "It looks like you've done a lot of exploring.\nIsn't it about time to get to know your\nServant a little better?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324068"
msgid "You may find a chance to learn your Servant's SG\nby hanging out with them in the school building.\nHow about you go #C000246204look around the building#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324228"
msgid "…that's the suggestion I got, out of nowhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324276"
msgid "Sure, we HAVE been trucking along non-stop.\nIf this will help give him a breather,\nmaybe I'll find out #C236196003Archer#CDEF's #RUBS      SG  #RUBEtrue colors#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324444"
msgid "Before I go into the Labyrinth,\nmaybe I should go #C000246204look around the school building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324544"
msgid "As I was about to enter the Labyrinth,\nsomething fell out of my pocket.\nIt's the \"#C000246204Free Ticket#CDEF\" I bought off that male student."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324688"
msgid "I don't what exactly is \"free,\" \nbut I need to be careful, as it's about to expire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324772"
msgid "Before entering the Labyrinth, let's check this item I have.\n…I may be feeling just a tiny bit unsure about this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1324888"
msgid "Just to double check, let's head to the #C000246204Commissary#CDEF.\nIt may have a new, useful item in stock."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325000"
msgid "Hold on a sec'!\n…your exploration of the Labyrinth\nis going alright, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325080"
msgid "I recommend the #C000246204Library#CDEF for\ngathering information. How about taking a look?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325172"
msgid "…that's the suggestion I got, out of nowhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325220"
msgid "Now that he mentions it, before we even get to #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's SGs,\nhis matrix is nearly blank, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325336"
msgid "Maybe I should take his advice and check out\nthe #C000246204library#CDEF before entering the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325440"
msgid "Hold on a sec'!\n…your exploration of the Labyrinth is\ngoing really well, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325524"
msgid "Before you go fight tougher enemies,\nI think you should make sure to learn\nmore about your Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325624"
msgid "…that's the suggestion I got, out of nowhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325672"
msgid "Now that he mentions it,\nI recall that I started reading\n\"#C000246204The Epic of Gilgamesh#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325772"
msgid "It might be a good idea to stop by the\n#C000246204Library#CDEF again before entering the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325872"
msgid "Hold on a sec'!\n…you're exploring the last leg of the\nLabyrinth now, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1325956"
msgid "…that's the suggestion I got, out of nowhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326004"
msgid "Now that he mentions it,\nI recall that I only have a little bit of\n\"#C000246204The Epic of Gilgamesh#CDEF\" left to read."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326128"
msgid "It might be a good idea to stop by the\n#C000246204Library#CDEF again before entering the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326228"
msgid "As soon as I leave the school building,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF stops me to talk.\nMaybe she wants to see me off?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326340"
msgid "…please be careful. The inside of the\nLabyrinth is #C000246204her#CDEF domain. If you run into her…\nAbsolutely, do not defy her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326472"
msgid "Judging by her manner of speaking,\n\"Her\" must refer to the Labyrinth's ruler…\nNo, the cause of our dilemma, it sounds like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326600"
msgid "Hm… It appears that acting outside the\nschool building demands from her a fair\namount of energy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326700"
msgid "What she said has me intrigued, but #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is an\nNPC… No, an advanced AI of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nPerhaps there are some things she cannot say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326872"
msgid "Yes, a duty of confidentiality, as they say.\nReticent ladies in the court are rarities.\nWe should cherish her well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1326988"
msgid "…a forced withdraw. Despite being an advanced\nAI, leaving the school puts a proportionate\namount of fatigue on her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1327108"
msgid "She probably has her own circumstances.\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's management of its AI\nis thorough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1327216"
msgid "Oh dear, she up and disappeared.\nIt seems her Spiritron capacity is insufficient\nto materialize outside the school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1327332"
msgid "Well, it's not that's she's simply inarticulate.\nThat person is an advanced AI of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1327448"
msgid "System maintenance is critical for the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. I figure she normally prioritizes\nsystem restoration over saving Masters…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1327592"
msgid "Well, this is the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF, and no\nimmediate penalty for deviating from AI\nprinciples. It's good that #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is our ally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1327760"
msgid "Besides, a secret is all the sweeter if stayed\na secret. Perhaps we should hurry\nto this #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF thing?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1327892"
msgid "I see. That's the AI who governs the old school\nbuilding. It seems that when outside the\nschool, she has no strength at all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328020"
msgid "However, she made quite a significant remark.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. That woman is staying silent\ndespite knowing what lies ahead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328156"
msgid "It must be some agreement with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nShe may be our ally, but she's unable\nto deviate from the rules, being an AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328296"
msgid "As a result, unable to utter the truth\nuntrusted by humans, she will be\nused as a tool until she breaks――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328404"
msgid "The very definition of a puppet's sorrow.\nBut don't pity her. Being used effectively\nis a weapon's joy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328508"
msgid "You people are prisoners of the old school\nbuilding, and she's a prisoner of the Moon.\nUse her to your advantage well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328628"
msgid "Sure, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's words concern me,\nbut our first priority right now is to\ninvestigate the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328800"
msgid "An unknown Arena, constructed in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF――\nIs there really something waiting for us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1328920"
msgid "Just now, there was an odd jamming…\nIt seems that some sort of singing voice\nwas obstructing our voice channel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329036"
msgid "However, we were getting all of your visuals.\nWe have confirmation on Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF\nand her Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329152"
msgid "We'll immediately prepare some countermeasures\nfor the wall and the jamming.\nPlease rest for now, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329276"
msgid "Good work, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF.\nI used my administrative privileges to create a\n#C000246204My Room#CDEF for you, so please use it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329412"
msgid "It's located #C000246204at the back of the second floor#CDEF.\nIt's been adjusted to cut off all monitoring;\na fully private room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329544"
msgid "…once I opened my eyes,\nI found myself in front of the cherry blossom tree."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329624"
msgid "I don't feel anything wrong with me.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF, who dematerialized, seems fine as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329724"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF… may have taken some damage,\nand has a pained expression on her face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329816"
msgid "It's so different from the Near Side school…\nMaybe this is a venue used in early #C000246204Holy Grail\nWars#CDEF, and got abandoned due to its age."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1329968"
msgid "Nevermind. Unnecessary details.\nWhere is #C236196003Leo#CDEF at?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330036"
msgid "From the grounds, I pointed up at\nthe second floor #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330128"
msgid "I explained, though briefly, the structure\nof the old school and who was inside it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330212"
msgid "…*sigh*. I really could use some more shuteye,\nbut this isn't the time to be talking like that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330312"
msgid "She walks limply, but who can blame her. She's\nbeen through so many tussles. She likely wants\nnothing to do with anyone for a while."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330448"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF truly is a fine woman. If I was her, I would\nbe holing myself up for a month right about now.\nI wish to learn from her resilience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330600"
msgid "That's very like her. Since she does things in\na firm way, she keeps her injuries to a minimum."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330696"
msgid "I sympathize as a comrade. Please treat her\nas if you never came upon her #C000246204SGs#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330792"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF… pushing herself so hard… She probably\nwants to escape reality and dive into an\ninfirmary bed saying, \"it was all a dream.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1330940"
msgid "What a tenacious person, don't you agree? I'm\nembarrassed to say I'm tempted to just call out\nto her, \"Yo! Money slave!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331064"
msgid "She appears enfeebled, but understands her duty.\nThat woman is suited to be a lieutenant, as I\nthought. Learn from her example, too, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331208"
msgid "Obviously, don't learn from what's inside her.\nHer first #C236196003SG#CDEF is especially unnecessary. If she\ndidn't have that, she'd be outstanding talent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331368"
msgid "And yet, as someone known to that\ndark, young girl―#C236196003BB#CDEF―\nshe went to the Student Council Room\nto offer information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331500"
msgid "I can't go whining about things either.\nI'll move myself to the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF\nand discuss the situation with everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331644"
msgid "Can you hear me, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF?\nUm, about reproducing your previous\noutfit―― Somehow, it was a success!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331760"
msgid "I can do it if I try! I'm proud of it――\nEven #C236196003Rin#CDEF complimented me on it. So please,\ndo come by the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331916"
msgid "The transmission came from an unusually\ncheerful #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1331992"
msgid "I wonder if she's happy about having managed\na role outside of her given public doctor role."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1332088"
msgid "You look bright. A gentle smile is lifting\nacross your lips. I don't know what is causing\nit, but that smile is one that I like."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1332220"
msgid "I can finally get back into my old outfit… hm?\nWhat's up? Remember a funny joke?\nThat's a strange smile you got there, #[Master][girl]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1332360"
msgid "…hmm. Seeeems like you have a reaall big,\nhappy smile there. Darling, I thiiink you have a\nsoft spot for #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1332492"
msgid "Hearing #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, I cover my mouth with my hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1332556"
msgid "The results of my scan shows that it's harmless.\nIf you're interested in it, then #C000246204please come to\nthe #C000246204Student Council Room to pick it up#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1332720"
msgid "It sounds like she took those comments on clothing\nbefore seriously. It won't bring back #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's\nlevels, but maybe it'll be the sort that's easier\nto move in than full-body armor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1332920"
msgid "How to uncover #C236196003Rani#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF, hm……?\nWe don't seem to have any leads at the moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333036"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF is the projection of a\nyoung girl's mind, which has become a Core.\nWe can only hope for a clue in the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333188"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret, huh…\nI feel as if the other two were like,\n\"Oh, yeah…\" but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333316"
msgid "That would be big trouble for us. If she herself\nhas a secret she doesn't know about, no amount\nof poking or prodding may do any good…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333452"
msgid "Lady #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret… Well, this is just my\nimpression, but she has an avid thirst for\nknowledge. A \"know-it-all,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333596"
msgid "I interpreted her first #C000246204SG#CDEF to be, essentially,\nthe desire for a prince on a white stallion.\nThus… the third may be surprisingly childish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333752"
msgid "Though she appears to be one without pity,\nperhaps she merely has yet to learn a way\nto express her emotions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333864"
msgid "You want to know about my secrets…?\nUs AI have a duty to answer any question,\nso strictly speaking, I have none."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1333980"
msgid "However, there are some matters in which we've\nbeen preset to keep silent on. Private matters\n―those would count as secrets to us AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334116"
msgid "If #C236196003Rani#CDEF is somewhat like us,\nthen I don't believe that she would ever\ntalk about her own secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334232"
msgid "I'm unable to define whether such instability\nis merely error, or something of the mind,\nthough…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334332"
msgid "What is it, anyway? About #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nJust rile her up somehow\nand it'll all come tumbling out, duh."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334452"
msgid "You're saying to challenge her to a competition?\nThat IS one idea. But, one thing…\nwhy is it that YOU know about our troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334580"
msgid "…a typical communication style for youth\nin the internet age… but #C236196003Shinji#CDEF:\nhow come you know what we're investigating?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334716"
msgid "Amuse her with a gamble, and expose her\ntrue colors… Yes, the basics are there. But,\nwhy do YOU know of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's troubles?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334860"
msgid "B-by accident! I just happened to overhear\nwhen I was in front of the Student Council Room!\nI don't want to join you guys or anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1334996"
msgid "Hm? You say you want to know #C236196003Rani#CDEF's secret?\nYou… Again you're becoming more of an\naudacious #[manly man][Amazoness]#――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1335136"
msgid "…hmph. I do owe you for saving me, and\nthis could be a chance to flaunt my strength\nif I can do it, but forget it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1335252"
msgid "I, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, am hopelessly clueless\nwhen it comes to the minds of women!\nEven Homer sometimes nods―― Gahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1335388"
msgid "I know, since I've been monitoring.\n#C236196003Rani#CDEF's last secret, right?\nMmm…. Can't really say I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1335504"
msgid "…let's see.\nThat young lady puts the conclusion\nfar too ahead of everything else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1335588"
msgid "Discernment over intuition,\nchoice by necessity over chance.\nWhat happens when one lives as such, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1335712"
msgid "Heck if I know.\nI'm pretty sure I told you not to redirect\nevery single topic over to #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1335824"
msgid "…lose the experience of defeat, you mean.\nWhen those who possess great insight evade\ndefeat too much, they unfamiliarize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1335952"
msgid "Victory is assured when it involves one's\nexpertise. If the result turns out unlike what\nshe expects, you may see signs of her mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336088"
msgid "…sorry, I said too much.\nAfter all, we merely observed over the monitor.\nI don't want you to take it to heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336200"
msgid "\"A maiden's secret\"? Ha! No need to mull\nover it for even a second! You really thought\nI would want to know something like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336332"
msgid "A young girl's troubles can always fall\ninto one of three groups: troubles over her\nface, over her chest, or over boys!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336452"
msgid "There's no other topic as worthless to study!\nIf you want some fortune telling on love,\nask someone else. It's not my act to play in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336588"
msgid "…I apologize. As you can see,\ndiscussions about innocent boys and girls\nputs him in a worse mood than usual."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336700"
msgid "But hey, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nThere's no special reason why #C236196003Rani#CDEF would\nhave a secret about love, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336828"
msgid "Such is the mind of a maiden, casually\nleveraging her assets to entice her interest.\nGood lord, she's so proud her face is frozen!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1336960"
msgid "Hypothetically, if ever there was a writer who\nwould do that, then they should hurry and settle\ndown and switch to making documentaries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337100"
msgid "She's supposed to be in the Student Council\nroom backing me up. I wonder why she's here?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337192"
msgid "…could it be that she's been waiting\nfor me… or something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337256"
msgid "…sorry. I had a question I really needed\nanswered, so I slipped out of the Student\nCouncil Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337356"
msgid "No, I won't give up even under these\ncircumstances. You all don't understand."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1337436"
msgid "I don't really know why."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1337464"
msgid "For everyone's sake."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1337488"
msgid "Because you looked like you were in pain."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1337532"
msgid "For everyone's sake.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "1337572"
msgid "Because you looked like you were in pain.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337632"
msgid "Is… that so.\nThough you don't know why, you believe.\nIt really is hard for an AI to grasp."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337724"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF gives a seemingly lonely laugh.\nCaught up in the moment, I also give a strained\nlaugh, and nod."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337844"
msgid "I don't know the reason why,\nbut… I can't go running away.\nSince that belief is lit up within me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1337944"
msgid "It wasn't that you fight even though you won't\nwin… You have to fight even if you don't\nwin, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338048"
msgid "Great! Now it seems like I can understand\nSenpai better!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338108"
msgid "I still haven't been able to analyze the cause,\nbut I want to try speaking with #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF\nmore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338220"
msgid "The reason why I fight, which #C236196003Sakura#CDEF came to ask me for…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338296"
msgid "While it is for the purpose of getting #C236196003Leo#CDEF, #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\nthe others, and myself out of here,\nit's also to assuage #C236196003Sakura#CDEF. Equally as much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338476"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF lowers her shoulders, and, while\nshrinking away, looks up at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338564"
msgid "I repeated the same answer.\nAs a result of restating myself, I became a bit shy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338648"
msgid "I will assist you!\nPlease, absolutely come back as the Senpai\nyou are now…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338728"
msgid "There's no need to bother everyone.\n#C236196003Leo#CDEF and #C236196003Rin#CDEF would probably\nflat-out say to reject it, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338860"
msgid "Ah. Your heart rate has returned to normal.\nYou must be tired.\nPlease #C000246204go to your room and get some rest#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1338984"
msgid "As if the door directly behind me\nhad morphed into a guillotine and slid down,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339064"
msgid "as if I'd left a cave I just took refuge in\nwithout realizing it was a tiger's den,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339148"
msgid "a feeling that I had just been\n\"unknowingly, yet fortunately spared.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339220"
msgid "Praetor, over there!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339244"
msgid "Behold, mongrel.\nThe #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF makes its campaign."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339312"
msgid "Whatever the case, we can't leave her be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339356"
msgid "#C236196003Passionlip#CDEF lowers both her arms and looks at us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339424"
msgid "A slight hostility dwelt in her eyes.\nIt's rare, considering she usually doesn't\ndisplay a hostile attitude."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339536"
msgid "…this is bad, there are people…\nHow could you go to get your #C000246204Memories#CDEF back…\nYou're so wonderful with amnesia, though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339676"
msgid "You're better off, not getting your #C000246204Memories#CDEF\nback… I mean, your #C000246204Memories#CDEF would bring all\nof your true feelings back…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339828"
msgid "I don't want to hear what you REALLY think…\nYour true self is just… harsh,\nand miserable… it's a waste."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1339936"
msgid "…I won't allow even you to mess that up if\nyou try to, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340016"
msgid "To make sure… sure you don't go back to how\nyou were, I'll… punish you. You'll understand\nand let me, right, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340152"
msgid "Her affection is so off-the-wall,\nit can hardly be called affection anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340232"
msgid "Destroying something you LOVE――\nThat's just plain insanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340296"
msgid "Think again. That there is merely narcissism.\nSure, true opinions can be harsh, ugly,\nand sharp. However――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340408"
msgid "It's about nestling together. Naked contact\nisn't done with only the body. Touching with\none's naked heart is a joy of life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340536"
msgid "My Praetor, you went beyond that,\nand sought to understand me.\n…it's a shame you don't remember right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340644"
msgid "#C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF, there. If you truly wish\nto understand a person's heart,\nthen lay your own heart bare."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340760"
msgid "…yeah. One's true opinions ought to be\nhidden, sure. As long as we got intelligence,\nhumans can't escape being selfish."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1340884"
msgid "――That said, there are times when you have\nto open up: with comrades, engaged in life\nand death. With life, companions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341008"
msgid "Forget your ideals, and even sometimes hurting\none another, build a bond without lies. It's for\ntheir own good, and your own good, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341144"
msgid "…but, you know. If I can be brutally honest\nfor a second, I agree with the premise of\n\"hiding one's true colors.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341260"
msgid "However, not being able to reveal yourself is\njust plain oppression. You can't seize true love\nwithout exposing your true self, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341400"
msgid "Unfortunately for you,\nwe have no obligation to get your permission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341472"
msgid "A person's true views and character can\nsometimes hurt. I was very mischievous a long\ntime ago, too. Well, a REALLY long time ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341604"
msgid "Nevertheless, my Darling was kind enough\nto try and get to know me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341672"
msgid "As faulty as I am, #[he][she]# listened to my heart,\nand heard of my scars, all with a smile."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341768"
msgid "Back to the point! Discussing true views is what\ntrue lovers are all about! To Hell with any\nsappy sweethearts that get in the way!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1341900"
msgid "If you don't want your true self to be known,\nthat means you're still a third-rate yandere!\nWash those claws and turn over a new leaf!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342036"
msgid "One's true nature can't be seen without one's\n#C000246204Memories#CDEF? Buffoon, you have it backwards!\n#C000246204Memories#CDEF are rationality. That is, a mask."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342200"
msgid "Isn't THIS #[man][woman]#, devoid of #[his][her]# #C000246204Memories#CDEF,\nexhibiting #[his][her]# true nature!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342316"
msgid "Moreover, you don't know WHAT love is in\nthe slightest! \"Love\" and whatnot sounds nice,\nbut ultimately, it's a vie for one's share."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342448"
msgid "It's something you portion out your life to,\ncompete for, steal, sometimes add to, and rear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342544"
msgid "#C000246204Memories#CDEF are unnecessary to know a person's\ntrue nature, but are essential for quality love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342656"
msgid "How do you want to love?\nHow do you want to be loved?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342712"
msgid "If you crave love, then first become aware\nto all this, and start afresh!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342788"
msgid "#C236196003Lip#CDEF's hostility entirely vanishes\nfrom being rebuked right to her face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1342876"
msgid "#C080080080She made an excessively brutal charge.\nIt was unthinkable for the #C236196003Lip#CDEF#C080080080\nwe knew to propel herself with such explosive force.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343044"
msgid "#C080080080There's no dodging it.#CDEF\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF#C080080080 won't be able to\nprotect me in time, either.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343168"
msgid "Man has #RUBSImmortal Souls#RUBEthree hun#REND and #RUBSCarnal Souls#RUBEseven po#REND.\nNamely, they are the Ten Sacred Treasures."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343300"
msgid "If you won't enlighten yourself to your\nown Buddha-nature, then I must gaze into your\ninner evil, and bring you to Nirvana."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343424"
msgid "Kya…!?\nWhat's… happening…?\nI can't maintain… my physical form…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343496"
msgid "A mantra?\nThe style is… of the Shingon Tachikawa school!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343556"
msgid "This is… the Shingon Tachikawa school,\nmy dear old Dakini rites…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343624"
msgid "…phew. That said, I haven't performed\nsuch a tough task in a long time.\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, are you alright?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343740"
msgid "It looks like that was her #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343804"
msgid "But… she said that she won't oppose #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nSo then, why would she do this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1343896"
msgid "No, inside the Labyrinth is one thing, but this\nneutral zone falls outside of our pact. I also\nhave Buddhist practices to adhere to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344032"
msgid "Besides…\nTo so easily lose such a good\nMaster and Servant as you two would pain me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344120"
msgid "From the first moment we met, though I was\nslightly aware of this… it seems that I've\nbeen especially fond of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344236"
msgid "Because of my occupation, perhaps I could say \nthat I'm attuned to pure minds and deep souls…\nI want you, somehow, to survive to the end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344376"
msgid "Hey. If you're going to drag this\n#[young man][decent young girl]# down some nonsense path,\nthen leave it for later."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344496"
msgid "That goes for you, too.\nDon't go hanging on this woman's every word.\nYou must have other things to take care of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344612"
msgid "After all, this woman isn't worth squat on\nher own. She's trash, actually. Raw trash.\nYou'll smell it if you get too close."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344736"
msgid "…*sigh*. All that comes out of your mouth is\nvitriol. Maybe you should forget YOUR true\nself, the opposite of an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344880"
msgid "Rubbish. \"True Self?\"\nBeing convinced that such a thing exists\nproves how stupid you are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1344972"
msgid "As if one could forever know their self.\nI'm proof of that. Why is that after I've died,\nI must once again pen fairy tales!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345100"
msgid "…this person would make for such a handy\nServant, if it weren't for that lash of\na tongue… please don't take offense to him."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345228"
msgid "I've put up a barrier, so she should be\nincapable of interfering any further, for now.\nPlease keep doing your best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345344"
msgid "She gently waves her hand,\nand #C236196003Kiara#CDEF and #C236196003Andersen#CDEF return to the school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345448"
msgid "Hm. I can't quite find the right words to\ndescribe that Master and Servant, but…\nThey're strange."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345548"
msgid "It matters not.\nRight now, we need to be clearing the Labyrinth.\nLet's go, Praetor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345632"
msgid "Let's head to the Labyrinth.\nWe can't let that #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF go running around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345724"
msgid "That was a close one, Darling.\nIt's hard to believe we would come\nacross an #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF here…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345836"
msgid "I'm concerned about her questionable verbiage\nat the end there, but whatever, I can just\ncurse her into dust. Yeah, let's ignore it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1345972"
msgid "…she displeases me. With no desire, no\nreward… no, she has desire. Selflessly, with no\nreward, she desires to save the world of man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1346108"
msgid "I've seen countless fools who sought to\nbring salvation to the world of man in order\nto bring bliss to the many."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1346224"
msgid "There were also morons who, despite suffering\nfrom their desires, would in the end be content\nwith their karma, and kept seeking answers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1346364"
msgid "It seems that woman truly intends on\ndevoting herself to all humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1346436"
msgid "If that ever came true, she would be neither a\nsaint nor a Heroic Spirit… but a savior,\nas they call them―a most repulsive person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1346572"
msgid "I open my eyes, and I see the grounds.\nWe got away from #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF in one piece."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1346672"
msgid "To her, knowing one of her copies has gone rogue\nmust make her feel twice as guilty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1346760"
msgid "To me, girls with her face have been trying to\nkill me left and right―― It's hard to relax around her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1346868"
msgid "I know #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF are different people,\nbut I just can't help it.\nHumans rely on visual information,\nso this kind of thing happens."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347044"
msgid "Alright, alright. Chill out for a second,\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF. It'll be faster if you look #[him][her]# over\nrather than have us do a scan."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347188"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF dropped some strange phrases.\nIt sounds like she has some ability that does\nmore than mere damage, so take a look."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347332"
msgid "But there's evidently some mental fatigue.\nI think you ought to go get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347416"
msgid "My nerves certainly have been hounded.\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is probably tired as well,\nso let's go on ahead to My Room and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347556"
msgid "We'll analyze #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF while you're doing\nthat. You'll probably fight her again at some\npoint. #C236196003Rani#CDEF, you got the data?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347712"
msgid "In addition to her #C000246204SG#CDEF, I finished extracting\na matrix from her combat style."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347808"
msgid "However… I cannot analyze her #C000246204invincibility#CDEF.\nI hope we can gather more information\nin the future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1347924"
msgid "Hear that? Do your best, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nNow then… I guess all that's left to\ndo is increase the jamming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348040"
msgid "Yes. I've already allocated 4% of the\nStudent Council Room's output towards it.\nIt was Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF's idea."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348164"
msgid "Yep. To make it harder for #C236196003BB#CDEF or an #C000246204Ego#CDEF to\nambush #C236196003#NICK#CDEF, we're hiding #[his][her]# location."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348308"
msgid "But it looks like it'll be tough to keep an\n#C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF out with this level of jamming.\nWe'll kick it up a notch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348436"
msgid "…so that's how it went down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348468"
msgid "#C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF was aggressive in seeking out my life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348536"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF said the jamming wasn't effective,\nbut if she hadn't taken the trouble to do this for me,\nI may have been killed long ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348680"
msgid "I see… I was wondering why I couldn't locate\nSenpai in the school building. Of course.\nSo you two were behind it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348796"
msgid "It's a little late for it, but I give them my thanks.\nThose two are always out of sight, but still helping me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1348908"
msgid "I-it's nothing special, really. It's a pretty\nboring secret tool, so I actually was\nhoping you wouldn't notice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349020"
msgid "In my opinion, that's not the case. It wasn't\nsomething I would've thought of. Your concern\nfor others is meticulous, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349168"
msgid "This is common sense when you've been in\nguerilla warfare as long as I have! It's crucial\nto scramble the enemy's navigation, seriously."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349308"
msgid "A-anyway, how about you head back to your\nMy Room? As annoying as it is, someone's got\ntheir eyes on you, so get plenty of rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349440"
msgid "That girl isn't much of a threat.\nWe'll be okay just dealing with her as\nshe pops up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349528"
msgid "…I think I heard a faint sneeze from somewhere.\nIn any case, let's call it for today."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349616"
msgid "And hang in there, #C236196003Archer#CDEF鷙\nIf you make our new president cry,\nthere will be hell to pay."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349724"
msgid "An #C000246204Ego#CDEF, pining for a Servant…\nWhat a VERY intriguing phenomenon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349808"
msgid "I mean, should we really call him \"#C236196003Archer#CDEF?\"\nAll I see is a smug, offensive, loquacious,\nfailure of a Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1349936"
msgid "…oh. Yeah, I knew someone like that once.\nOn Earth, we had someone come coach our military\nexercises for a month."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350052"
msgid "You're his spitting image, #C236196003Archer#CDEF. Hm? Maybe\nyou're even the same age? His nationality…\nI never did hear what it was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350188"
msgid "…I wonder what happened to that guy.\nWhen large fires broke out, he apparently\nalways came to the rescue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350296"
msgid "\n…I awake from a heavy darkness.\n…it seems that I was out for quite a long while."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350380"
msgid "…with my consciousness still unsteady,\n  I give my arms, hands, and body a once over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350468"
msgid "…I'm in one piece.\n…these are the old school building's grounds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350536"
msgid "…apparently, I was able to make a clean getaway,\n…out of that unidentifiable predicament,\n  in front of that colossal Labyrinth Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350672"
msgid "Are you okay, Praetor!? Answer me! Don't you\nknow that it's polite to spring to your feet\nwhen I'm worrying over you!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350792"
msgid "Get a hold of yourself, we're still alive!\nWake up! If you fall asleep now you won't\nbe able to come back!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1350900"
msgid "Darling, come back to your senses!\nThe thread of your soul is coming loose!\nPlease don't leave me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351000"
msgid "Stay conscious. Don't fall asleep. If this were\nthe end, the only thing left to do would be\nfor me to personally snuff you out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351128"
msgid "…I'm still struggling to pour strength\n  into my hand, but I move it:\n  I #SVT[pat #C236196003Saber#CDEF's head][signal to #C236196003Archer#CDEF][rub #C236196003Caster#CDEF's ears][look at #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF]# and say, \"I'm alright.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351372"
msgid "…mhm.\nDo as you please. I don't mind.\nYour hand is warm. I'm happy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351444"
msgid "…alright, don't push yourself.\nIt's enough to know you're conscious again.\nDon't move around for now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351548"
msgid "Take a deep breath, slowly feel your\nlimbs again.\nIt'll help your blood circulate, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351636"
msgid "Your psychological state has a stronger effect\non your body here than it does on Earth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351724"
msgid "Ah, well, I'd normally love to have you\ntouching them, but giving me no warning\nis a no-go!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351816"
msgid "If you had said, \"I'm gonna dote on you now☆\"\nright before, then I would've been okay\nwith you doing anything!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1351928"
msgid "…my body might just still be sleeping by how heavy it is,\n  but seeing #C236196003Caster#CDEF be her usual self puts me at ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352060"
msgid "Ahhn♪ Oh, Darling.\nYou've been so adventurous since you woke up鷙\nWhatever shall #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF do～!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352172"
msgid "Ah, but I'm quite gladdened by this. I'm ready\nto follow you to the afterlife when the time\ncomes, but it's far too early for you――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352308"
msgid "――You're awake. It appears the outer layer\nof your mind has gone numb, but it's nothing.\nSo long as you feel fear, you're still human."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352448"
msgid "Breath a while and rest your thoughts. You faced\nthe unmistakable might of a god. It will take\nsome time for your instincts to settle down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352588"
msgid "…listening to #C236196003#SVT#CDEF, I rest for a while.\n…soon enough, I feel better.\n…I stand up to find I can walk without any issue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352728"
msgid "…it's like my brain has turned into lead.\n…I got out of that predicament,\n  but my mind is still completely restless."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352848"
msgid "…usually, no matter what pinch I was in,\n  the moment I returned alive,\n  I felt a relief that would ease my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1352964"
msgid "…then, thinking about it,\n  it hit me like a divine revelation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353032"
msgid "…it's natural for me to feel down.\n  After all, I still haven't gotten away\n  from the fear I just experienced."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353148"
msgid "…there's nothing I can do about it now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353192"
msgid "…I made it back to the old school building, a safe zone,\n  but that darkness still lingers in my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353296"
msgid "Looky here! My processing speed is as fast as \nlightning! You look like you're in good shape,\ntoo, but I'll give you a run for your money."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353436"
msgid "I removed various guards, making me more solid.\nI feel refreshed, like when a diet starts\nshowing progress."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353544"
msgid "Yeah, it's just like when you start trimming\nsome belly squish―― Er, forget it.\nNevermind. I've never been fat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353660"
msgid "A-anyway, I'm all set on my side.\nDon't worry about a thing,\njust jump straight into that final battle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353764"
msgid "All my self-diagnosis system levels are nominal.\nI'm able to maintain my avatar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353848"
msgid "However… Every time I think about how I'll\nnever see this setting again, my emotion\nregulator produces not unpleasant feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1353980"
msgid "My self-diagnoses aren't being affected,\nso it may be a product of my cerebral nerves…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1354068"
msgid "It surprises even me that I have such thoughts\nof \"attachment\" to this place,\nhaving kept so distant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1354172"
msgid "My #C000246204SGs#CDEF were forcibly extracted,\nI had disgraceful qualities made up for me――\nMy time here was quite the headache…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1354308"
msgid "But now, I feel like even those errors\nare precious to me. All in all,\nI think I had a worthwhile experience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1354420"
msgid "Now please head off to battle.\nIt's time for you to put an end to this,\nby your own hands."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1354512"
msgid "Ah… e-erm… I-I don't really have any\nwords to send you off with!\nI couldn't think of anything \"cool\" to say…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "1354624"
msgid "I'm hopeless, aren't I…\nAll I can ever talk about is work…"
msgstr ""

